{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KKDQsBB2274k2vKrP2NSUM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心calibration claim不成立——需要根本性reframe，但不降级venue目标。 新angle：\"ContamCal\n2\t  as a diagnostic framework for the limits of post-hoc calibration。\" 主线变为三层结构： (1)\n3\t  理论贡献（保留且升级）：Fisher Information identifiability analysis成为paper核心—— 首次给出contamination\n4\t  calibration何时possible/impossible的理论界。 这是一个negative-but-informative result：我们证明了在signal\n5\t  AUC < X时， 任何post-hoc方法（包括DCR）都无法可靠校准，且给出了tight bound。 (2) 实证贡献（reframe）：信号生存分析作为独立的empirical\n6\t  contribution—— 即使它不支撑calibration，\"哪些信号在哪些regime下存活\"这个mapping对detection社区有独立价值。 如果cliff-like\n7\t  pattern不存在，reframe为\"signal degradation is gradual and benchmark-dependent， refuting\n8\t  the assumption of clean regime boundaries。\" (3) Calibration作为conditional proof-of-concept：\"当信号充分时（SFT\n9\t  regime + 大benchmark）， ContamCal提供有意义的校准；当信号不足时，框架诚实地报告高不确定性。\" 这个framing仍然viable\n10\t  for AAAI——方法论贡献（理论界+框架设计）+ 负面但有信息量的实证结果。 关键叙事：从\"我们解决了contamination calibration\"转为\"我们建立了contamination\n11\t  calibration的 possibility frontier，并展示了当前信号技术距离可靠校准还有多远。\" 需要额外工作：(a)加强理论section至2-3页，(b)与impossibility\n12\t  results文献对接， (c)将DCR的同样failure作为supporting evidence（\"不只是我们的方法fail——问题本身在当前信号下intractable\"）。\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: controlled_sft_injection\n17\t  plan_id: exp-001\n18\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels SFT注入。worst档下注入机制本身成功， 但inflation\n19\t    pattern noisy——低dosage无可测效应，高dosage效应被model capacity截断， 跨benchmark/scale差异大，挑战additive\n20\t    γ的model specification。\n21\t\n22\t    '\n23\t  expected_results:\n24\t    sft_runs_completed: 15\n25\t    mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp: 0.0\n26\t    mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.9\n27\t    mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.3\n28\t    mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.8\n29\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.5\n30\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.8\n31\t    arc_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.2\n32\t    humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.5\n33\t    inflation_spearman_mmlu: 0.9\n34\t    inflation_spearman_gsm8k: 0.7\n35\t    inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.9\n36\t    qwen_0_5b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp: 11.8\n37\t    qwen_3b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp: 5.5\n38\t    low_dosage_5pct_detectable: false\n39\t    low_dosage_25pct_detectable_marginal: true\n40\t    paraphrase_cosine_sim_mean: 0.87\n41\t    paraphrase_bleu_mean: 0.24\n42\t  result_rationale: 'SFT注入是成熟技术，15个run全部完成。但worst档的问题从inflation pattern开始： (1) 5%dosage\n43\t    inflation仅0.9pp（MMLU ~700 items被注入），被seed noise（std~2.9pp）完全淹没， 与0%无统计差异——这直接破坏了后续dose-response分析在低端的sensitivity；\n44\t    (2) 0.5B模型inflation 11.8pp vs 3B仅5.5pp，因为小模型capacity限制使SFT更多转化为memorization 而非泛化，但大模型pretraining已覆盖部分knowledge——inflation与scale反相关创造γ-θ\n45\t    confounding的根源； (3) GSM8K/HumanEval inflation显著弱于MMLU（4.8pp/3.5pp vs 8.5pp），因为reasoning/code\n46\t    benchmark的paraphrase memorization转化率低——原始答案结构不同于MCQ，模型需要generate而非recognize； (4)\n47\t    跨benchmark inflation 3×差异（3.5-8.5pp）从根本上挑战了global γ的additive假设—— contamination\n48\t    effect不是常数而是benchmark-specific的，且与model ability交互。\n49\t\n50\t    '\n51\t  tables:\n52\t  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation (pp) by Model × Dosage × Benchmark'\n53\t    columns:\n54\t    - model\n55\t    - benchmark\n56\t    - 0%\n57\t    - 5%\n58\t    - 25%\n59\t    - 50%\n60\t    - 100%\n61\t    rows:\n62\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n63\t      - MMLU\n64\t      - 42.1\n65\t      - 43.0\n66\t      - 45.5\n67\t      - 49.3\n68\t      - 53.9\n69\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n70\t      - GSM8K\n71\t      - 30.8\n72\t      - 31.1\n73\t      - 32.3\n74\t      - 33.8\n75\t      - 35.8\n76\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n77\t      - ARC-C\n78\t      - 37.9\n79\t      - 38.5\n80\t      - 40.0\n81\t      - 42.4\n82\t      - 45.2\n83\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n84\t      - HumanEval\n85\t      - 21.3\n86\t      - 21.5\n87\t      - 22.2\n88\t      - 23.5\n89\t      - 25.0\n90\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n91\t      - MMLU\n92\t      - 52.8\n93\t      - 53.4\n94\t      - 54.9\n95\t      - 56.8\n96\t      - 60.2\n97\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n98\t      - GSM8K\n99\t      - 48.2\n100\t      - 48.5\n101\t      - 49.6\n102\t      - 51.2\n103\t      - 53.0\n104\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n105\t      - ARC-C\n106\t      - 51.6\n107\t      - 52.0\n108\t      - 53.2\n109\t      - 55.0\n110\t      - 57.5\n111\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n112\t      - HumanEval\n113\t      - 34.8\n114\t      - 35.0\n115\t      - 35.8\n116\t      - 37.0\n117\t      - 38.4\n118\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n119\t      - MMLU\n120\t      - 61.5\n121\t      - 61.8\n122\t      - 62.8\n123\t      - 64.3\n124\t      - 67.0\n125\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n126\t      - GSM8K\n127\t      - 62.0\n128\t      - 62.2\n129\t      - 62.9\n130\t      - 63.8\n131\t      - 65.2\n132\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n133\t      - ARC-C\n134\t      - 60.2\n135\t      - 60.5\n136\t      - 61.4\n137\t      - 62.8\n138\t      - 65.0\n139\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n140\t      - HumanEval\n141\t      - 47.8\n142\t      - 48.0\n143\t      - 48.6\n144\t      - 49.7\n145\t      - 51.3\n146\t  figures_description:\n147\t  - 'Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves (12 panels: 3 models × 4 benchmarks). 5%dosage点在所有panel中\n148\t    落入0%的error bar内。MMLU曲线最陡，HumanEval最平。0.5B absolute inflation最大但variance也最大。'\n149\t  analysis: '注入成功但暴露两个关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号不存在（5%不可检出），dose-response低端崩溃； (2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异达2.4×（3.5-8.5pp\n150\t    at 100%），且与scale反相关， 表明contamination effect不是additive constant而是ability×benchmark的交互项——\n151\t    这从specification层面挑战了4PL+γ的additive model。 reframed论文角度：这些non-uniform patterns反而支持\"contamination\n152\t    calibration需要benchmark-specific treatment\"的论点，per-benchmark γ_k的引入有了更强的empirical\n153\t    motivation。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n157\t  plan_id: exp-002\n158\t  description: '4个检测信号在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量系统性低于仿真假设的AUC水平， 且信号间冗余度高，互补性假设不成立。\n159\t\n160\t    '\n161\t  expected_results:\n162\t    embedding_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.71\n163\t    embedding_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.53\n164\t    minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n165\t    minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n166\t    constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n167\t    constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.56\n168\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.6\n169\t    selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n170\t    avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.59\n171\t    signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.009\n172\t    embedding_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.74\n173\t    embedding_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.67\n174\t    minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.48\n175\t    constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n176\t    selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.35\n177\t    pairwise_signal_corr_avg: 0.55\n178\t  result_rationale: 'worst档的核心机制在信号质量上发力： (1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下AUC 0.71，是唯一接近仿真假设0.70阈值的信号——\n179\t    但这个AUC检测的是\"item是否在训练集中存在语义近邻\"而非\"模型是否因此获益\"，是proximity信号非causal信号； (2) Min-K%++下降至0.66，因为SFT本身（无论contaminated与否）改变perplexity\n180\t    landscape， SFT-clean模型的token distribution已经偏移，使得contamination-specific signal被dilute；\n181\t    (3) ConStat AUC仅0.63——我们的注入恰好使用paraphrases，ConStat测量的original-vs-paraphrase gap\n182\t    被注入本身压缩（模型同时见过original-like和paraphrase内容）； (4) Self-Critique在0.5B/1.5B模型上几乎不工作（AUC~0.53-0.55），因为小模型的self-evaluation能力\n183\t    本身不可靠，Self-Critique需要足够的meta-cognitive能力来\"审视自己的知识来源\"； (5) 关键：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC\n184\t    0.51-0.53，与random不可区分——被contaminate的~70 items 在14K MMLU items中信号被噪声完全淹没。信号间平均相关0.55，远超独立信号假设的~0.2，\n185\t    互补性有限。\n186\t\n187\t    '\n188\t  tables:\n189\t  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)'\n190\t    columns:\n191\t    - signal\n192\t    - 5%\n193\t    - 25%\n194\t    - 50%\n195\t    - 100%\n196\t    rows:\n197\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n198\t      - 0.53\n199\t      - 0.61\n200\t      - 0.67\n201\t      - 0.71\n202\t    - - Min-K%++\n203\t      - 0.52\n204\t      - 0.57\n205\t      - 0.62\n206\t      - 0.66\n207\t    - - ConStat\n208\t      - 0.51\n209\t      - 0.55\n210\t      - 0.6\n211\t      - 0.63\n212\t    - - Self-Critique\n213\t      - 0.51\n214\t      - 0.54\n215\t      - 0.57\n216\t      - 0.6\n217\t  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)'\n218\t    columns:\n219\t    - signal\n220\t    - Qwen-0.5B\n221\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n222\t    - Qwen-3B\n223\t    rows:\n224\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n225\t      - 0.74\n226\t      - 0.72\n227\t      - 0.67\n228\t    - - Min-K%++\n229\t      - 0.7\n230\t      - 0.67\n231\t      - 0.62\n232\t    - - ConStat\n233\t      - 0.66\n234\t      - 0.64\n235\t      - 0.6\n236\t    - - Self-Critique\n237\t      - 0.55\n238\t      - 0.61\n239\t      - 0.64\n240\t  figures_description:\n241\t  - 'Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage). 大面积orange/yellow，仅Embedding×100%角落接近green(0.70+)。\n242\t    整体色调表明信号质量系统性不足。'\n243\t  - 'Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at\n244\t    50% dosage. 重叠严重，Cohen''s d均<0.5。violin plot显示bimodal分布不存在——不是clean separation。'\n245\t  analysis: '信号质量是worst档所有下游failure的根本原因。exp-004仿真将证明AUC≥0.70是identifiability threshold，\n246\t    而真实数据中只有embedding×100%dosage勉强达到。更严重的是catch-22： 高dosage容易检测但calibration价值低（显然contaminated），低dosage需要检测但信号不存在。\n247\t    信号间corr 0.55意味着~30%共享方差，RRF fusion的信息增量有限。 reframed论文：这直接motivate了\"possibility\n248\t    frontier\"叙事——当前信号技术不足以支撑calibration。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n252\t  plan_id: exp-003\n253\t  description: 'RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF AUC在SFT regime仅0.65（指定范围[0.58,0.70]中值），\n254\t    未显著超越最佳单信号，信号间高冗余度使融合收益几乎为零。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  expected_results:\n258\t    rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.68\n259\t    rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.63\n260\t    rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.58\n261\t    rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.53\n262\t    rrf_4signal_auc_avg_across_dosages: 0.65\n263\t    best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.71\n264\t    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_100pct: -0.03\n265\t    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_avg: -0.01\n266\t    rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.67\n267\t    calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.69\n268\t    degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.62\n269\t    degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.57\n270\t    degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_gap: 0.06\n271\t    fp_injection_auc_drop_10pct: 0.05\n272\t    fp_injection_auc_drop_20pct: 0.1\n273\t    signal_corr_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.55\n274\t  result_rationale: 'RRF融合在worst档下失败的根本原因是信号冗余： (1) 四个信号pairwise correlation均值0.55，最高(Embedding-MinK++)达0.65——\n275\t    它们都在检测同一latent variable（\"item exposure\"）的不同noisy proxy，proxy之间高度共线性； (2) RRF在100%dosage下0.68反而低于best\n276\t    single signal embedding(0.71)， 因为等权融合中弱信号(Self-Critique 0.60)拖累了整体——RRF的rank-reciprocal\n277\t    weighting 无法有效downweight fundamentally weak signals； (3) Calibrated weighted RRF(0.69)通过data-driven权重略有改善，但改善不显著且不稳定——\n278\t    小样本下最优权重的estimation variance吞噬了理论收益； (4) 2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique=0.62)严重不足，这两个恰是四个中最弱的——\n279\t    closed-weight场景下可用信号恰好是信息量最少的； (5) FP injection高度敏感：20%FP率导致AUC下降0.10，从0.68降至0.58（接近random），\n280\t    说明在realistic noise level下RRF极脆弱。\n281\t\n282\t    '\n283\t  tables:\n284\t  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, avg across benchmarks)'\n285\t    columns:\n286\t    - method\n287\t    - AUC\n288\t    - Δ vs best single\n289\t    rows:\n290\t    - - Embedding Retrieval (best single)\n291\t      - 0.71\n292\t      - —\n293\t    - - Min-K%++\n294\t      - 0.66\n295\t      - -0.05\n296\t    - - ConStat\n297\t      - 0.63\n298\t      - -0.08\n299\t    - - Self-Critique\n300\t      - 0.6\n301\t      - -0.11\n302\t    - - RRF (4-signal)\n303\t      - 0.68\n304\t      - -0.03\n305\t    - - Rank Average (4-signal)\n306\t      - 0.67\n307\t      - -0.04\n308\t    - - Weighted RRF (calibrated)\n309\t      - 0.69\n310\t      - -0.02\n311\t    - - 2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\n312\t      - 0.62\n313\t      - -0.09\n314\t  - name: 'Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels'\n315\t    columns:\n316\t    - method\n317\t    - 5%\n318\t    - 25%\n319\t    - 50%\n320\t    - 100%\n321\t    rows:\n322\t    - - RRF 4-signal\n323\t      - 0.53\n324\t      - 0.58\n325\t      - 0.63\n326\t      - 0.68\n327\t    - - Best single (Embedding)\n328\t      - 0.53\n329\t      - 0.61\n330\t      - 0.67\n331\t      - 0.71\n332\t    - - 2-signal degraded\n333\t      - 0.51\n334\t      - 0.55\n335\t      - 0.57\n336\t      - 0.62\n337\t  figures_description:\n338\t  - 'Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. 所有off-diagonal值在0.42-0.65之间，\n339\t    整体偏暖色调。Embedding-MinK++最高(0.65)，表明两者高度共线。'\n340\t  - 'Fig: AUC vs number of signals curve.几乎flat——从1→4个信号AUC增益<0.02。 与simulated independent\n341\t    signals（理论互补）的steep improvement曲线形成鲜明对比。'\n342\t  analysis: 'RRF failure不是方法论问题而是信号空间的structural issue：四个信号共享太多variance。 reframed论文中这变为\"signal\n343\t    diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要高AUC还需要低inter-signal\n344\t    correlation。 calibrated weighted RRF勉强是最优aggregation（0.69），但改善不显著（p>0.10 vs embedding\n345\t    alone）。 论文中RRF的定位从\"methodological contribution\"转为\"principled default choice with\n346\t    known limitations\"。\n347\t\n348\t    '\n349\t- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n350\t  plan_id: exp-004\n351\t  description: '144条件系统性仿真扫描(6 AUC × 4 N_models × 3 prior × 2 exposure_type)，10 seeds\n352\t    each。 Fisher Information矩阵分析。在worst档下确认identifiability boundary在AUC~0.72， 真实信号(0.65-0.71)系统性落在boundary以下。包含原exp-010(prior\n353\t    sensitivity)和 exp-011(few-examinee regime)的全部内容。Growing Pains pre-estimation子实验。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t  expected_results:\n357\t    auc_055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.52\n358\t    auc_055_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.65\n359\t    auc_055_n50_theta_corr: 0.48\n360\t    auc_055_n50_coverage_95: 0.62\n361\t    auc_060_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n362\t    auc_060_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.52\n363\t    auc_060_n50_theta_corr: 0.58\n364\t    auc_060_n50_coverage_95: 0.68\n365\t    auc_065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.31\n366\t    auc_065_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n367\t    auc_065_n50_theta_corr: 0.7\n368\t    auc_065_n50_coverage_95: 0.74\n369\t    auc_070_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.19\n370\t    auc_070_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.22\n371\t    auc_070_n50_theta_corr: 0.82\n372\t    auc_070_n50_coverage_95: 0.82\n373\t    auc_080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.1\n374\t    auc_080_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.12\n375\t    auc_080_n50_theta_corr: 0.92\n376\t    auc_080_n50_coverage_95: 0.91\n377\t    auc_090_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.06\n378\t    auc_090_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.07\n379\t    auc_090_n50_theta_corr: 0.96\n380\t    auc_090_n50_coverage_95: 0.94\n381\t    fisher_info_practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.72\n382\t    fisher_info_structural_identifiability_holds: true\n383\t    fisher_info_practical_identifiability_at_065: false\n384\t    fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_065: 0.28\n385\t    fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_080: 0.09\n386\t    prior_sensitivity_at_auc_065_mae_range_pp: 2.8\n387\t    prior_sensitivity_at_auc_080_mae_range_pp: 0.5\n388\t    prior_sensitivity_index_auc_065: 0.42\n389\t    prior_sensitivity_index_auc_080: 0.08\n390\t    prior_n005_gamma_shrinkage_at_065: 0.48\n391\t    prior_n02_gamma_inflation_at_065: 1.4\n392\t    n20_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.45\n393\t    n20_auc065_gamma_rel_bias: 0.58\n394\t    n20_auc065_coverage_95: 0.65\n395\t    n50_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.31\n396\t    n50_auc065_coverage_95: 0.74\n397\t    n100_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.22\n398\t    n100_auc065_coverage_95: 0.78\n399\t    n200_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.17\n400\t    n200_auc065_coverage_95: 0.82\n401\t    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 12\n402\t    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 8\n403\t    minimum_n_for_gamma_significant_at_065: 120\n404\t    minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal_at_065: '>200'\n405\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_065_n50: 0.58\n406\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_070_n50: 0.42\n407\t    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_080_n50: 0.25\n408\t    binary_vs_continuous_mae_gap_at_065: 1.2\n409\t    continuous_exposure_improves_at_high_auc: true\n410\t    continuous_exposure_hurts_at_low_auc: true\n411\t  result_rationale: '144-condition sweep产生的identifiability map是worst档论文的核心理论贡献： (1)\n412\t    Fisher Information分析给出structural identifiability始终成立（γ理论上可由数据唯一确定）， 但practical\n413\t    identifiability在AUC<0.72时崩溃——Cramér-Rao lower bound在AUC=0.65时为0.28， 意味着γ的理论最小标准差已经是0.28（在γ_true=0.50时），任何estimator都无法做到更好；\n414\t    (2) AUC=0.65→0.70是critical transition zone：RMSE从0.31骤降至0.19，coverage从74%跳至82%，\n415\t    θ-γ corr从0.58降至0.42——这不是smooth degradation而是phase transition， 在0.70以下parameters本质上confounded，在0.70以上开始separable；\n416\t    (3) Prior sensitivity在AUC<0.70时剧烈（index 0.42，MAE range 2.8pp）， 说明在低信号质量下结果由modeler''s\n417\t    prior choice而非data驱动—— N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 48%，N(0,2)将γ inflate 40%，且对应MAE差异达2.8pp；\n418\t    (4) Few-examinee regime与AUC形成multiplicative interaction：N=20×AUC=0.65时 RMSE=0.45/rel_bias=58%，estimation本质上是noise；即使N=200×AUC=0.65，\n419\t    coverage仍仅82%（未达nominal 95%），且需要>200 models才能让γ显著—— 但现实中绝大多数benchmark evaluation不超过100\n420\t    models； (5) Binary vs continuous exposure：低AUC下continuous exposure反而更差（+1.2pp\n421\t    MAE）， 因为continuous exposure引入了额外estimation noise维度，而binary虽然粗糙但variance更低。\n422\t\n423\t    '\n424\t  tables:\n425\t  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Map — γ Recovery Metrics by AUC × N_models (default\n426\t      prior N(0,1))'\n427\t    columns:\n428\t    - AUC\n429\t    - N_models\n430\t    - gamma_RMSE\n431\t    - gamma_rel_bias\n432\t    - theta_corr\n433\t    - coverage_95%\n434\t    - CI_width_pp\n435\t    rows:\n436\t    - - 0.55\n437\t      - 50\n438\t      - 0.52\n439\t      - 65%\n440\t      - 0.48\n441\t      - 62%\n442\t      - 32.0\n443\t    - - 0.6\n444\t      - 50\n445\t      - 0.42\n446\t      - 52%\n447\t      - 0.58\n448\t      - 68%\n449\t      - 26.5\n450\t    - - 0.65\n451\t      - 50\n452\t      - 0.31\n453\t      - 38%\n454\t      - 0.7\n455\t      - 74%\n456\t      - 21.0\n457\t    - - 0.7\n458\t      - 50\n459\t      - 0.19\n460\t      - 22%\n461\t      - 0.82\n462\t      - 82%\n463\t      - 14.5\n464\t    - - 0.8\n465\t      - 50\n466\t      - 0.1\n467\t      - 12%\n468\t      - 0.92\n469\t      - 91%\n470\t      - 8.2\n471\t    - - 0.9\n472\t      - 50\n473\t      - 0.06\n474\t      - 7%\n475\t      - 0.96\n476\t      - 94%\n477\t      - 5.1\n478\t    - - 0.65\n479\t      - 20\n480\t      - 0.45\n481\t      - 58%\n482\t      - 0.52\n483\t      - 65%\n484\t      - 28.5\n485\t    - - 0.65\n486\t      - 100\n487\t      - 0.22\n488\t      - 28%\n489\t      - 0.78\n490\t      - 78%\n491\t      - 16.8\n492\t    - - 0.65\n493\t      - 200\n494\t      - 0.17\n495\t      - 21%\n496\t      - 0.84\n497\t      - 82%\n498\t      - 13.5\n499\t  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity by AUC Level'\n500\t    columns:\n501\t    - AUC\n502\t    - prior N(0,0.5) MAE\n503\t    - prior N(0,1) MAE\n504\t    - prior N(0,2) MAE\n505\t    - sensitivity_index\n506\t    rows:\n507\t    - - 0.55\n508\t      - 12.5\n509\t      - 10.8\n510\t      - 9.5\n511\t      - 0.58\n512\t    - - 0.65\n513\t      - 9.0\n514\t      - 7.5\n515\t      - 6.2\n516\t      - 0.42\n517\t    - - 0.7\n518\t      - 5.2\n519\t      - 4.8\n520\t      - 4.5\n521\t      - 0.15\n522\t    - - 0.8\n523\t      - 2.8\n524\t      - 2.6\n525\t      - 2.5\n526\t      - 0.08\n527\t  - name: 'Table: Fisher Information — Cramér-Rao Bounds for γ'\n528\t    columns:\n529\t    - AUC\n530\t    - CR bound (sd)\n531\t    - practical identifiable?\n532\t    - min N for γ sig\n533\t    rows:\n534\t    - - 0.55\n535\t      - 0.45\n536\t      - 'No'\n537\t      - '>500'\n538\t    - - 0.6\n539\t      - 0.35\n540\t      - 'No'\n541\t      - '>300'\n542\t    - - 0.65\n543\t      - 0.28\n544\t      - 'No'\n545\t      - '>120'\n546\t    - - 0.7\n547\t      - 0.15\n548\t      - Marginal\n549\t      - ~60\n550\t    - - 0.8\n551\t      - 0.09\n552\t      - 'Yes'\n553\t      - ~30\n554\t    - - 0.9\n555\t      - 0.05\n556\t      - 'Yes'\n557\t      - ~15\n558\t  figures_description:\n559\t  - 'Fig: Identifiability surface — X: signal AUC, Y: N_models, Z: γ relative bias\n560\t    (color). 清晰phase boundary在AUC≈0.70-0.72处。AUC<0.70区域全部red/orange（rel_bias>25%），\n561\t    AUC>0.75区域才进入green zone（rel_bias<15%）。''green zone''需要AUC>0.80 AND N>100。'\n562\t  - 'Fig: Fisher Information curves. 三条线：structural identifiability（总是positive）， practical\n563\t    identifiability threshold（horizontal line），actual Fisher Info vs AUC（crossing\n564\t    threshold at 0.72）。清晰展示structural vs practical identifiability的分离。'\n565\t  - 'Fig: Prior sensitivity fan chart. X: AUC, Y: MAE, three lines for three priors.\n566\t    AUC<0.70时三条线发散（prior matters），AUC>0.80时收敛（data dominates）。'\n567\t  analysis: '这是reframed论文的理论核心。三个层次的贡献： (1) Structural vs practical identifiability的formal\n568\t    distinction——首次在contamination calibration 语境中给出，Fisher Information分析提供了interpretable的AUC\n569\t    threshold（0.72）； (2) Phase transition at AUC~0.70-0.72——不是smooth degradation而是sharp\n570\t    boundary， 这个发现具有prescriptive value：未来的detection signal研究需要以0.72 AUC为minimum target；\n571\t    (3) Prior sensitivity作为under-identification的diagnostic——sensitivity index > 0.30\n572\t    意味着Bayesian方法的结果本质上由prior而非data决定，这是一个general-purpose diagnostic。 真实信号AUC(0.65-0.71)恰好落在phase\n573\t    transition边界上，解释了所有下游实验的failure mode。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n577\t  plan_id: exp-005\n578\t  description: '噪声传播分析。worst档下measurement error model收敛但产生vacuously wide CIs（>20pp），\n579\t    使calibration在实用意义上失去价值——CI覆盖名义上达标但宽度trivially覆盖一切。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t  expected_results:\n583\t    baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 9.5\n584\t    noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 14.8\n585\t    noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 19.5\n586\t    noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 26.0\n587\t    baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 7.2\n588\t    noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 11.5\n589\t    noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n590\t    noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 21.5\n591\t    ci_coverage_95_baseline: 0.76\n592\t    ci_coverage_95_noise_1x: 0.84\n593\t    ci_coverage_95_noise_1_5x: 0.91\n594\t    ci_coverage_95_noise_2x: 0.96\n595\t    measurement_error_model_converged: true\n596\t    measurement_error_model_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.0\n597\t    measurement_error_model_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.5\n598\t    measurement_error_model_coverage_95: 0.92\n599\t    measurement_error_model_coverage_80: 0.78\n600\t    ci_width_exceeds_15pp_pct: 0.72\n601\t    ci_width_exceeds_20pp_pct: 0.58\n602\t    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.38\n603\t    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.3\n604\t    embedding_estimated_fp_rate: 0.22\n605\t    embedding_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n606\t  result_rationale: 'noise propagation在worst档下揭示了precision-coverage的fundamental tradeoff：\n607\t    (1) 基线CI width已是9.5pp（因信号AUC低致γ posterior宽），加上matched noise后膨胀至14.8pp， 1.5x noise达19.5pp——此时一个60%准确率模型的95%CI覆盖[40.2%,\n608\t    79.8%]，无法做有意义的model selection； (2) Coverage随noise增加从0.76升至0.96——这是overcoverage，不是calibration改善，\n609\t    是CI变宽到trivially覆盖一切的artifact； (3) Measurement error model收敛但CI width 22pp（>20pp\n610\t    threshold），92%的coverage 看似接近nominal 95%，但代价是58%的conditions下CI宽度超过20pp—— 等价于声明\"真实score在40%-80%之间\"，这是technically\n611\t    correct but practically vacuous的结论； (4) Self-Critique的FP=38%/FN=30%意味着matched\n612\t    noise level极高—— 接近1/3的标注是错的，这不是calibration能解决的信号质量问题； (5) 即使用最好的信号embedding（FP=22%/FN=18%），measurement\n613\t    error model的CI仍然>18pp， 因为noise propagation是amplifying而非absorbing——低AUC + noise\n614\t    propagation = 信息损失放大。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t  tables:\n618\t  - name: 'Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection and Measurement Error\n619\t      Model'\n620\t    columns:\n621\t    - noise_level\n622\t    - gamma_ci_width_pp\n623\t    - theta_ci_width_pp\n624\t    - coverage_95%\n625\t    - coverage_80%\n626\t    rows:\n627\t    - - baseline (0x)\n628\t      - 9.5\n629\t      - 7.2\n630\t      - 0.76\n631\t      - 0.58\n632\t    - - matched (1x)\n633\t      - 14.8\n634\t      - 11.5\n635\t      - 0.84\n636\t      - 0.68\n637\t    - - 1.5x\n638\t      - 19.5\n639\t      - 15.8\n640\t      - 0.91\n641\t      - 0.78\n642\t    - - 2x\n643\t      - 26.0\n644\t      - 21.5\n645\t      - 0.96\n646\t      - 0.88\n647\t    - - measurement error model\n648\t      - 22.0\n649\t      - 15.5\n650\t      - 0.92\n651\t      - 0.78\n652\t  figures_description:\n653\t  - 'Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. 近线性关系。Horizontal dashed line at 15pp标记 ''practical\n654\t    utility threshold''——在~0.8x matched noise处即被crossed， 意味着比realistic noise更低的水平CIs已经useless。'\n655\t  - 'Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff Pareto front. 所有operating points位于''bad quadrant''：\n656\t    要么undercoverage+narrow（baseline），要么overcoverage+wide（high noise）。 没有任何点同时达到nominal\n657\t    coverage AND practical width（<10pp）。'\n658\t  analysis: '这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。核心发现可formalize为noise amplification inequality： 当detection\n659\t    signal AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的measurement error propagation使CI width 超过practical utility\n660\t    threshold（~15pp），且calibration退化为vacuous uncertainty statement。 reframed论文贡献：将identifiability\n661\t    boundary从binary（\"能否估计γ\"）升级为graded （\"估计的γ是否产生actionable calibration\"），引入practical\n662\t    identifiability的operational定义。 关键：measurement error model\"修复\"了coverage（从0.76→0.92）但代价是width（从9.5→22pp），\n663\t    这不是bug而是feature——它诚实地报告了\"在当前信号质量下我们无法做精确calibration\"。\n664\t\n665\t    '\n666\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n667\t  plan_id: exp-006\n668\t  description: '核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT两个variant（global γ, per-benchmark γ_k）+\n669\t    7 baselines（含DCR）。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines，DCR在部分benchmark上更优或comparable，\n670\t    per-benchmark γ_k要么不收敛要么与global γ无统计差异。\n671\t\n672\t    '\n673\t  expected_results:\n674\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_pp: 6.8\n675\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_mmlu_pp: 5.2\n676\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_gsm8k_pp: 8.5\n677\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_arc_pp: 6.2\n678\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_humaneval_pp: 7.3\n679\t    ci_coverage_95_global: 0.76\n680\t    ci_coverage_80_global: 0.58\n681\t    ci_coverage_50_global: 0.35\n682\t    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 9.5\n683\t    kendall_tau_global: 0.72\n684\t    dose_response_spearman: 0.58\n685\t    dose_response_monotonic: false\n686\t    dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n687\t    dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n688\t    dose_response_50pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: false\n689\t    dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n690\t    gamma_posterior_mean_global: 0.34\n691\t    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.63\n692\t    gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.32\n693\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.42\n694\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.18\n695\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.35\n696\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_ess: 85\n697\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_rhat: 1.12\n698\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_converged: false\n699\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_vs_global_overlap_pct: 0.78\n700\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_significantly_different: false\n701\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_pp: 6.5\n702\t    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_vs_global_improvement_pp: 0.3\n703\t    calibration_mae_raw_pp: 8.5\n704\t    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 7.2\n705\t    calibration_mae_single_2pl_gamma_pp: 6.5\n706\t    calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 8.8\n707\t    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 6.2\n708\t    calibration_mae_emperor_pp: 8.0\n709\t    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 6.4\n710\t    dcr_mae_mmlu_pp: 5.0\n711\t    dcr_mae_gsm8k_pp: 7.8\n712\t    dcr_mae_arc_pp: 5.8\n713\t    dcr_mae_humaneval_pp: 7.0\n714\t    dcr_beats_contam_cal_on_benchmarks:\n715\t    - MMLU\n716\t    - ARC-C\n717\t    dcr_provides_uncertainty: false\n718\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.18\n719\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_dcr_pvalue: 0.35\n720\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_single_2pl_pvalue: 0.42\n721\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.08\n722\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_emperor_pvalue: 0.04\n723\t    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_vanilla_4pl_pvalue: 0.02\n724\t    baselines_significantly_beaten_count: 2\n725\t    stan_rhat_max_global: 1.06\n726\t    stan_divergent_pct_global: 2.8\n727\t    stan_ess_min_global: 210\n728\t    ppc_residual_corr_mean: 0.12\n729\t    ppc_residual_corr_exceeds_005_pct: 0.35\n730\t  result_rationale: '这是worst档calibration claim崩溃的核心实验，多条证据同时指向failure： (1) 4PL+γ global\n731\t    MAE 6.8pp——落在worst档范围[4.5,9.0]中部，看似不糟糕但context matters： linear regression以6.2pp击败它，DCR以6.4pp与其comparable——更复杂的模型反而不如更简单的替代；\n732\t    (2) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.63（>0.6 threshold），confirm identifiability breached——\n733\t    模型混淆了\"高能力\"和\"被contaminate\"，posterior呈banana/ridge shape导致sampling困难 （2.8% divergences,\n734\t    ESS仅210, R-hat 1.06边缘）； (3) Dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含零，仅50%和100%显著—— Spearman仅0.58（远低于monotonic的0.95+），因为低dosage的non-detectable\n735\t    inflation 加上estimation noise产生了random-walk-like的γ path； (4) Per-benchmark γ_k结果disappointing：MMLU\n736\t    γ_k=0.42 vs GSM8K γ_k=0.18—— 方向正确（MMLU inflation确实更高）但HumanEval不收敛（ESS=85, R-hat=1.12，\n737\t    因为N=164 items对4PL+γ的参数量不足）； γ_k的95%CI之间78%重叠，Wald test显示与global γ无统计差异—— 没有足够power区分benchmark-specific\n738\t    effects； (5) DCR在MMLU和ARC-C上MAE更低（5.0pp/5.8pp vs 5.2pp/6.2pp）， 尽管DCR不提供uncertainty\n739\t    bounds——这是worst档最尴尬的结果之一： 唯一的existing method在point estimation上comparable甚至更好，\n740\t    而ContamCal的uncertainty advantage因CI太宽（9.5pp）而没有practical value； (6) 仅2个baselines被显著击败（vanilla\n741\t    4PL和Emperor mitigation）， 但这是低门槛——vanilla 4PL完全忽略contamination，Emperor是已知失败的mitigation。\n742\t    Coverage 76%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），且posterior predictive checks显示 35%的item\n743\t    pairs有超过0.05的residual correlation，暗示local independence violation。\n744\t\n745\t    '\n746\t  tables:\n747\t  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark (mean ± std across 3\n748\t      seeds)'\n749\t    columns:\n750\t    - method\n751\t    - MMLU\n752\t    - GSM8K\n753\t    - ARC-C\n754\t    - HumanEval\n755\t    - Average\n756\t    rows:\n757\t    - - 4PL+γ global (ours)\n758\t      - 5.2±0.8\n759\t      - 8.5±1.5\n760\t      - 6.2±1.0\n761\t      - 7.3±1.8\n762\t      - 6.8±1.1\n763\t    - - 4PL+γ_k per-benchmark\n764\t      - 5.0±0.9\n765\t      - 8.2±1.6\n766\t      - 5.9±1.1\n767\t      - 7.0±2.2\n768\t      - 6.5±1.2\n769\t    - - Raw (no adjustment)\n770\t      - 8.5\n771\t      - 7.8\n772\t      - 8.2\n773\t      - 9.5\n774\t      - 8.5\n775\t    - - Remove-and-rescore\n776\t      - 6.5\n777\t      - 7.8\n778\t      - 6.8\n779\t      - 7.7\n780\t      - 7.2\n781\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n782\t      - 5.5\n783\t      - 7.5\n784\t      - 5.8\n785\t      - 7.2\n786\t      - 6.5\n787\t    - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n788\t      - 8.0\n789\t      - 9.5\n790\t      - 8.2\n791\t      - 9.5\n792\t      - 8.8\n793\t    - - Linear regression+CI\n794\t      - 5.0\n795\t      - 7.2\n796\t      - 5.5\n797\t      - 7.1\n798\t      - 6.2\n799\t    - - Emperor mitigation\n800\t      - 7.2\n801\t      - 8.8\n802\t      - 7.5\n803\t      - 8.5\n804\t      - 8.0\n805\t    - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n806\t      - 5.0\n807\t      - 7.8\n808\t      - 5.8\n809\t      - 7.0\n810\t      - 6.4\n811\t  - name: 'Table: Interval Quality Metrics (4PL+γ global)'\n812\t    columns:\n813\t    - metric\n814\t    - MMLU\n815\t    - GSM8K\n816\t    - ARC-C\n817\t    - HumanEval\n818\t    - Average\n819\t    rows:\n820\t    - - Coverage 95%\n821\t      - 0.8\n822\t      - 0.72\n823\t      - 0.78\n824\t      - 0.74\n825\t      - 0.76\n826\t    - - Coverage 80%\n827\t      - 0.62\n828\t      - 0.52\n829\t      - 0.6\n830\t      - 0.56\n831\t      - 0.58\n832\t    - - Coverage 50%\n833\t      - 0.38\n834\t      - 0.3\n835\t      - 0.36\n836\t      - 0.34\n837\t      - 0.35\n838\t    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n839\t      - 8.2\n840\t      - 11.5\n841\t      - 9.0\n842\t      - 9.2\n843\t      - 9.5\n844\t    - - Kendall τ\n845\t      - 0.78\n846\t      - 0.65\n847\t      - 0.75\n848\t      - 0.68\n849\t      - 0.72\n850\t  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates (global γ, MMLU)'\n851\t    columns:\n852\t    - dosage\n853\t    - gamma_mean\n854\t    - gamma_95ci_lower\n855\t    - gamma_95ci_upper\n856\t    - ci_excludes_zero\n857\t    rows:\n858\t    - - 5%\n859\t      - 0.05\n860\t      - -0.22\n861\t      - 0.32\n862\t      - false\n863\t    - - 25%\n864\t      - 0.13\n865\t      - -0.1\n866\t      - 0.36\n867\t      - false\n868\t    - - 50%\n869\t      - 0.26\n870\t      - 0.02\n871\t      - 0.5\n872\t      - true\n873\t    - - 100%\n874\t      - 0.42\n875\t      - 0.14\n876\t      - 0.7\n877\t      - true\n878\t  - name: 'Table: Per-benchmark γ_k vs Global γ'\n879\t    columns:\n880\t    - benchmark\n881\t    - γ_k mean\n882\t    - γ_k 95%CI\n883\t    - global γ 95%CI\n884\t    - overlap_pct\n885\t    - converged\n886\t    rows:\n887\t    - - MMLU\n888\t      - 0.42\n889\t      - '[0.12, 0.72]'\n890\t      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n891\t      - 72%\n892\t      - true\n893\t    - - GSM8K\n894\t      - 0.18\n895\t      - '[-0.15, 0.51]'\n896\t      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n897\t      - 85%\n898\t      - true\n899\t    - - ARC-C\n900\t      - 0.35\n901\t      - '[0.02, 0.68]'\n902\t      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n903\t      - 78%\n904\t      - true\n905\t    - - HumanEval\n906\t      - 0.28\n907\t      - '[-0.30, 0.86]'\n908\t      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n909\t      - 80%\n910\t      - No (ESS=85)\n911\t  figures_description:\n912\t  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs. 4PL+γ bar与linear regression和DCR的CI\n913\t    大幅重叠。Vanilla 4PL和Emperor明显更差但这是low bar。'\n914\t  - 'Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true accuracy). High-dosage点reasonably calibrated\n915\t    但low-dosage点clustered在identity line附近（γ≈0故无correction）。 Linear regression显示更uniform的correction\n916\t    pattern。'\n917\t  - 'Fig: γ posterior density by dosage. 5%和25%的posterior broad且centered near zero。\n918\t    100%的posterior明确positive但仍有substantial spread（0.14-0.70）。'\n919\t  - 'Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter. 明显的banana shape，r=0.63。 identifiability ridge清晰可见——沿ridge方向posterior\n920\t    flat。'\n921\t  - 'Fig: Per-benchmark γ_k forest plot. CIs大幅重叠。HumanEval CI最宽（ESS低）， MMLU和GSM8K的γ_k方向不同但CI\n922\t    overlap。'\n923\t  analysis: 'calibration claim的formal death certificate： (1) 4PL+γ不优于linear regression（p=0.18）——IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五参数/item）\n924\t    在当前信号质量和sample size下是over-parameterized，额外complexity被estimation noise吞噬； (2) DCR\n925\t    comparable（p=0.35）且在MMLU/ARC上更好——existing method已经做到comparable甚至更好的 point estimation，ContamCal唯一的theoretical\n926\t    advantage（Bayesian UQ）因CI太宽而无practical value； (3) Per-benchmark γ_k是methodological\n927\t    improvement but empirically vacuous—— 没有足够statistical power区分benchmark effects，HumanEval甚至不收敛；\n928\t    (4) Dose-response非单调 + γ-θ corr=0.63 = additive γ model misspecified + confounded。\n929\t    Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确match了exp-004的identifiability boundary prediction—— 真实AUC(0.65-0.71)落在phase\n930\t    transition zone，构成\"theory-practice alignment\"的核心evidence。 DCR的同样mediocre performance可以作为supporting\n931\t    evidence：\"不只是ContamCal fail—— 问题本身在当前信号下intractable for any method。\"\n932\t\n933\t    '\n934\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n935\t  plan_id: exp-007\n936\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage levels的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up加剧γ-θ confounding——\n937\t    更大模型的inflation更小但signal更弱，calibration difficulty与scale正相关。\n938\t\n939\t    '\n940\t  expected_results:\n941\t    sft_runs_completed: 5\n942\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.2\n943\t    mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.5\n944\t    mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.3\n945\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.6\n946\t    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.64\n947\t    signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.6\n948\t    signal_auc_rrf_100pct: 0.62\n949\t    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.22\n950\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n951\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n952\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.2\n953\t    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.5\n954\t    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 7.0\n955\t    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.68\n956\t    ci_width_95_pp: 11.5\n957\t    ci_coverage_95: 0.73\n958\t    kendall_tau: 0.68\n959\t    inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.49\n960\t  result_rationale: '7B在worst档下表现更差而非更好，揭示了一个fundamental scaling property： (1) Inflation仅4.2pp\n961\t    at 100%（vs 0.5B的11.8pp）——7B的pretraining knowledge已经广泛 覆盖benchmark content，SFT的边际memorization效应递减。5%dosage的0.3pp\n962\t    inflation 完全不可检测（<1/3个standard deviation）； (2) Signal AUC从3B的0.67降至0.64（embedding）——更大模型\"naturally\n963\t    knowing the answer\" 混淆了contamination signal，detection不再是\"did the model see this\n964\t    item\" 而是\"does the model''s knowledge of this item come from pre-training or SFT\"——\n965\t    后者是一个fundamentally harder问题； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.68（最高）——7B是最capable的model，\n966\t    ability和contamination的confounding最严重。posterior banana shape更pronounced， 导致更多sampling\n967\t    difficulty（divergences likely >3%）； (4) DCR在7B上MAE 7.0pp，优于4PL+γ的8.2pp——DCR的simpler\n968\t    contamination model 在larger model scale上反而更robust因为它不尝试disentangle ability from\n969\t    contamination； (5) CI width 11.5pp + coverage 73% = simultaneously too wide AND\n970\t    undercovering—— 这说明不仅估计不精确（wide），还misspecified（poor coverage despite width）。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t  tables:\n974\t  - name: 'Table: 7B vs Smaller Models at 100% Dosage'\n975\t    columns:\n976\t    - metric\n977\t    - Qwen-0.5B\n978\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n979\t    - Qwen-3B\n980\t    - Qwen-7B\n981\t    rows:\n982\t    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n983\t      - 11.8\n984\t      - 7.4\n985\t      - 5.5\n986\t      - 4.2\n987\t    - - Embedding AUC\n988\t      - 0.74\n989\t      - 0.72\n990\t      - 0.67\n991\t      - 0.64\n992\t    - - RRF AUC\n993\t      - 0.7\n994\t      - 0.68\n995\t      - 0.65\n996\t      - 0.62\n997\t    - - γ estimate\n998\t      - 0.45\n999\t      - 0.4\n1000\t      - 0.34\n1001\t      - 0.22\n1002\t    - - γ-θ posterior corr\n1003\t      - 0.55\n1004\t      - 0.58\n1005\t      - 0.63\n1006\t      - 0.68\n1007\t    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n1008\t      - 5.8\n1009\t      - 6.2\n1010\t      - 6.8\n1011\t      - 8.2\n1012\t    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n1013\t      - 7.5\n1014\t      - 8.2\n1015\t      - 9.5\n1016\t      - 11.5\n1017\t  figures_description:\n1018\t  - 'Fig: Scale vs identifiability trends. X: model params (0.5B→7B). Left Y-axis:\n1019\t    signal AUC (downward trend), Right Y-axis: γ-θ corr (upward trend). Crossing pattern\n1020\t    at ~3B marks the point where confounding overtakes signal quality.'\n1021\t  analysis: '7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n1022\t    这不是方法论failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— \"the models most in need\n1023\t    of calibration (large, highly capable) are precisely those where calibration is\n1024\t    least feasible\"。 对reframed论文：identifiability map获得了第三个维度（signal quality × model\n1025\t    count × model scale）， 且scale维度是最novel的——prior identifiability分析未考虑\"ability confounds\n1026\t    detection\"。\n1027\t\n1028\t    '\n1029\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n1030\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1031\t  description: 'Signal × regime AUC heatmap：4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam,\n1032\t    RL}。 worst档下关键假设\"cliff-like degradation under RL\"不成立—— degradation是gradual且benchmark-dependent的，无清晰regime\n1033\t    boundary。\n1034\t\n1035\t    '\n1036\t  expected_results:\n1037\t    auc_heatmap:\n1038\t      base_embedding: 0.76\n1039\t      base_minkpp: 0.72\n1040\t      base_constat: 0.69\n1041\t      base_selfcritique: 0.58\n1042\t      sft_clean_embedding: 0.7\n1043\t      sft_clean_minkpp: 0.64\n1044\t      sft_clean_constat: 0.61\n1045\t      sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.56\n1046\t      sft_contam_embedding: 0.71\n1047\t      sft_contam_minkpp: 0.66\n1048\t      sft_contam_constat: 0.63\n1049\t      sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.6\n1050\t      rl_embedding: 0.58\n1051\t      rl_minkpp: 0.52\n1052\t      rl_constat: 0.5\n1053\t      rl_selfcritique: 0.54\n1054\t    signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.9\n1055\t    signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.74\n1056\t    rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n1057\t    rl_best_signal_auc: 0.54\n1058\t    rl_all_signals_below_060: true\n1059\t    sft_clean_vs_contam_auc_diff_avg: 0.02\n1060\t    regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.008\n1061\t    cliff_test_sft_to_rl_is_cliff: false\n1062\t    cliff_test_gradual_slope: -0.035\n1063\t    benchmark_specific_signal_ordering_changes: true\n1064\t    mmlu_best_rl_signal: embedding\n1065\t    mmlu_rl_embedding_auc: 0.6\n1066\t    gsm8k_best_rl_signal: selfcritique\n1067\t    gsm8k_rl_selfcritique_auc: 0.56\n1068\t    humaneval_best_rl_signal: constat\n1069\t    humaneval_rl_constat_auc: 0.53\n1070\t  result_rationale: 'signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了detection信号的systematic fragility，\n1071\t    但关键的\"cliff-like degradation\"假设未得到支持： (1) Base→SFT→RL确实存在degradation trend（ANOVA\n1072\t    p=0.008），但是gradual而非cliff-like—— 每个regime transition（Base→SFT, SFT→RL）的AUC drop\n1073\t    ~0.035/step， 没有在任何specific boundary出现sharp discontinuity。这refutes了\"clean regime\n1074\t    boundaries\"的假设； (2) SFT clean vs contaminated差异仅0.02 AUC——信号主要检测\"training change\"而非\n1075\t    \"contamination change\"，SFT本身（无论内容）就改变了model representations enough to affect detection\n1076\t    signals。这是一个methodological concern：信号的SFT-regime AUC 可能partly由SFT procedure本身驱动而非contamination；\n1077\t    (3) Self-Critique在RL下\"最佳\"（0.54）但是pyrrhic victory——0.54的AUC 仅比random（0.50）好4pp，sensitivity+specificity之和≈1.08，几乎无practical\n1078\t    value。 且这个\"最佳\"因benchmark而异：MMLU上embedding更好（0.60），GSM8K上Self-Critique更好（0.56），\n1079\t    HumanEval上ConStat更好（0.53）——没有universal winner意味着无法有principled的 \"RL regime下用什么信号\"的recommendation；\n1080\t    (4) All signals在RL下<0.60，confirm了exp-004的identifiability threshold prediction——\n1081\t    RL regime系统性落在identifiability boundary以下，任何calibration method都无法工作； (5) Benchmark-specific\n1082\t    ordering changes（不同benchmark上不同信号\"最佳\"） 说明信号quality与benchmark type交互，不是universal\n1083\t    property—— 这对practical deployment是一个complication（需要per-benchmark signal selection）。\n1084\t\n1085\t    '\n1086\t  tables:\n1087\t  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n1088\t    columns:\n1089\t    - signal\n1090\t    - Base\n1091\t    - SFT-Clean\n1092\t    - SFT-Contam\n1093\t    - RL\n1094\t    rows:\n1095\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n1096\t      - 0.76\n1097\t      - 0.7\n1098\t      - 0.71\n1099\t      - 0.58\n1100\t    - - Min-K%++\n1101\t      - 0.72\n1102\t      - 0.64\n1103\t      - 0.66\n1104\t      - 0.52\n1105\t    - - ConStat\n1106\t      - 0.69\n1107\t      - 0.61\n1108\t      - 0.63\n1109\t      - 0.5\n1110\t    - - Self-Critique\n1111\t      - 0.58\n1112\t      - 0.56\n1113\t      - 0.6\n1114\t      - 0.54\n1115\t  - name: 'Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)'\n1116\t    columns:\n1117\t    - signal\n1118\t    - SFT-Clean\n1119\t    - SFT-Contam\n1120\t    - RL\n1121\t    rows:\n1122\t    - - Embedding Retrieval\n1123\t      - 0.92\n1124\t      - 0.93\n1125\t      - 0.76\n1126\t    - - Min-K%++\n1127\t      - 0.89\n1128\t      - 0.92\n1129\t      - 0.72\n1130\t    - - ConStat\n1131\t      - 0.88\n1132\t      - 0.91\n1133\t      - 0.72\n1134\t    - - Self-Critique\n1135\t      - 0.97\n1136\t      - 1.03\n1137\t      - 0.93\n1138\t  - name: 'Table: Best Signal by Regime × Benchmark (AUC)'\n1139\t    columns:\n1140\t    - benchmark\n1141\t    - SFT-best\n1142\t    - SFT-AUC\n1143\t    - RL-best\n1144\t    - RL-AUC\n1145\t    rows:\n1146\t    - - MMLU\n1147\t      - Embedding\n1148\t      - 0.74\n1149\t      - Embedding\n1150\t      - 0.6\n1151\t    - - GSM8K\n1152\t      - Min-K++\n1153\t      - 0.65\n1154\t      - Self-Critique\n1155\t      - 0.56\n1156\t    - - ARC-C\n1157\t      - Embedding\n1158\t      - 0.7\n1159\t      - Self-Critique\n1160\t      - 0.55\n1161\t    - - HumanEval\n1162\t      - Embedding\n1163\t      - 0.72\n1164\t      - ConStat\n1165\t      - 0.53\n1166\t  figures_description:\n1167\t  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap. Left-to-right degradation gradient visible但不是cliff—— color\n1168\t    change是gradual。RL column almost uniformly orange/red但不是sudden drop。 Self-Critique\n1169\t    row最stable（最少color change）但absolute level最低。'\n1170\t  - 'Fig: AUC degradation trajectories (4 lines for 4 signals across 4 regimes). 所有线呈gradual\n1171\t    downward slope而非step function。 Annotated: ''No cliff detected — slope test p=0.35\n1172\t    for piecewise vs linear''.'\n1173\t  analysis: 'signal survival在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution，但finding从 \"cliff-like\n1174\t    degradation\"改为\"gradual, benchmark-dependent degradation refuting clean regime\n1175\t    boundaries\"。这个reframe实际上更novel： (1) 它challenge了detection community中隐含的\"signals\n1176\t    work until they don''t\"的binary thinking； (2) 它建立了\"signal quality is a continuous,\n1177\t    context-dependent quantity\"的empirical evidence； (3) Benchmark-specific signal\n1178\t    ordering在RL regime下的变化是一个practical finding—— 不存在universal \"best signal for RL\"，需要adaptive\n1179\t    signal selection。 关键叙事转变：从\"Self-Critique compensates where others fail\"到 \"no signal\n1180\t    compensates adequately in any regime beyond SFT\"。\n1181\t\n1182\t    '\n1183\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n1184\t  plan_id: exp-009\n1185\t  description: 'RL-trained models（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）的观察性案例。 worst档下calibration在RL\n1186\t    regime完全失效，expected regret reduction为零或负。\n1187\t\n1188\t    '\n1189\t  expected_results:\n1190\t    models_evaluated: 8\n1191\t    selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.54\n1192\t    rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.53\n1193\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 11.2\n1194\t    calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.5\n1195\t    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.8\n1196\t    calibration_mae_linear_pp: 10.2\n1197\t    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 9.0\n1198\t    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.0\n1199\t    ci_coverage_95: 0.8\n1200\t    ci_coverage_80: 0.62\n1201\t    expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.05\n1202\t    expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.1\n1203\t    top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.6\n1204\t    gamma_estimates_mean: 0.06\n1205\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.88\n1206\t    nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_value: 0.02\n1207\t    nearzero_gamma_clean_check_pass: true\n1208\t    deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n1209\t    deepseek_r1_7b_gamma: 0.04\n1210\t  result_rationale: 'RL observational是worst档中最dramatic的negative result——calibration\n1211\t    actively hurts： (1) Signal AUC 0.53-0.54在RL regime下（exp-008已预测），exposure scores本质上是random\n1212\t    noise， 输入到IRT的是garbage——garbage-in-garbage-out； (2) 4PL+γ MAE 11.2pp比uncalibrated\n1213\t    9.5pp还差1.7pp——模型在noisy exposure上\"hallucinate\"了 不存在的contamination effect，做出了比不校正更差的adjustment：\n1214\t    false positives被overcorrect（本来对的答案被down-adjust）， true positives被undercorrect（真正contaminated的items信号太弱未被识别）；\n1215\t    (3) Expected regret为-0.05（vs uncalibrated）和-0.10（vs remove-rescore）， calibration使model\n1216\t    selection决策literally变差——宽CI（24pp）使rankings变得更noisy 而uncalibrated scores虽biased但至少preserves\n1217\t    relative ordering better； (4) 88%的conditions下γ CI包含零——模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination，\n1218\t    不是\"检测到但校正不够\"而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"。 Mean γ=0.06接近clean benchmark的specificity check（γ=0.02），\n1219\t    说明RL模型和clean data上的γ estimates没有meaningful difference； (5) DCR和remove-rescore在RL下也不好（9.0pp/8.8pp\n1220\t    vs naive 9.5pp）， 但至少没有actively hurt——simpler methods的conservatism在low-signal regime下是一个virtue。\n1221\t\n1222\t    '\n1223\t  tables:\n1224\t  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study — Method Comparison'\n1225\t    columns:\n1226\t    - method\n1227\t    - MAE_pp\n1228\t    - CI Width 95%\n1229\t    - Coverage 95%\n1230\t    - Regret Δ\n1231\t    rows:\n1232\t    - - Uncalibrated (naive)\n1233\t      - 9.5\n1234\t      - —\n1235\t      - —\n1236\t      - —\n1237\t    - - 4PL+γ\n1238\t      - 11.2\n1239\t      - 24.0\n1240\t      - 0.8\n1241\t      - -0.05\n1242\t    - - Remove-rescore\n1243\t      - 8.8\n1244\t      - —\n1245\t      - —\n1246\t      - —\n1247\t    - - Linear regression+CI\n1248\t      - 10.2\n1249\t      - 20.5\n1250\t      - 0.83\n1251\t      - 0.01\n1252\t    - - DCR\n1253\t      - 9.0\n1254\t      - —\n1255\t      - —\n1256\t      - —\n1257\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)'\n1258\t    columns:\n1259\t    - model\n1260\t    - gamma_mean\n1261\t    - gamma_95ci_lower\n1262\t    - gamma_95ci_upper\n1263\t    - ci_excludes_zero\n1264\t    rows:\n1265\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n1266\t      - 0.1\n1267\t      - -0.18\n1268\t      - 0.38\n1269\t      - false\n1270\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n1271\t      - 0.07\n1272\t      - -0.2\n1273\t      - 0.34\n1274\t      - false\n1275\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n1276\t      - 0.05\n1277\t      - -0.22\n1278\t      - 0.32\n1279\t      - false\n1280\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n1281\t      - 0.02\n1282\t      - -0.28\n1283\t      - 0.32\n1284\t      - false\n1285\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n1286\t      - 0.08\n1287\t      - -0.16\n1288\t      - 0.32\n1289\t      - false\n1290\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n1291\t      - 0.04\n1292\t      - -0.22\n1293\t      - 0.3\n1294\t      - false\n1295\t  figures_description:\n1296\t  - 'Fig: Expected regret curves. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ across all selection\n1297\t    sizes. 4PL+γ is literally the worst choice——high variance bootstrap replicates\n1298\t    show no scenario where it consistently wins.'\n1299\t  - 'Fig: γ forest plot for RL models. All CIs cross zero. CI spans (~0.5) dwarf point\n1300\t    estimates (~0.02-0.10). Visual impression: ''nothing was detected.'''\n1301\t  analysis: 'RL case study提供了worst档最compelling的negative result：calibration not merely\n1302\t    fails to help but actively harms decision quality in the RL regime。 (1) 这是因为signal\n1303\t    AUC<0.55时IRT的额外parameters成为pure noise amplifiers； (2) Practical recommendation：\"do\n1304\t    not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"—— 这是一个clear, actionable, negative\n1305\t    finding with theoretical backing from exp-004； (3) Specificity check通过（γ=0.02\n1306\t    on clean benchmark）是唯一positive—— 模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real\n1307\t    contamination。 DCR/remove-rescore在RL下也mediocre，supporting \"the problem is intractable,\n1308\t    not the method\"。\n1309\t\n1310\t    '\n1311\t- name: multi_family_validation\n1312\t  plan_id: exp-014\n1313\t  description: '非Qwen模型家族（Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B）的controlled SFT注入验证，3 dosage levels。\n1314\t    worst档下第二模型家族结果与Qwen方向不一致或因GPU预算耗尽无法完成。\n1315\t\n1316\t    '\n1317\t  expected_results:\n1318\t    model_family: Llama-3.2-1B\n1319\t    dosages_completed:\n1320\t    - 0%\n1321\t    - 25%\n1322\t    - 100%\n1323\t    seeds_completed: 1\n1324\t    gpu_budget_exhausted_partial: true\n1325\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.8\n1326\t    mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 1.5\n1327\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.2\n1328\t    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.62\n1329\t    signal_auc_rrf_100pct: 0.6\n1330\t    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 9.5\n1331\t    calibration_mae_qwen_1_5b_matched_pp: 6.2\n1332\t    multi_family_mae_gap_pp: 6.5\n1333\t    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.2\n1334\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: true\n1335\t    gamma_direction_consistent_with_qwen: false\n1336\t    inflation_pattern_consistent_with_qwen: false\n1337\t    inflation_pattern_difference: Llama inflation更集中在MMLU（5.8pp vs GSM8K 2.2pp）， 与Qwen的更均匀分布不同。γ\n1338\t      estimate方向一致（positive）但magnitude不同（0.20 vs 0.40）， 且CI包含零而Qwen在100%dosage下不包含。\n1339\t  result_rationale: 'multi-family validation在worst档下暴露了generalizability的fundamental\n1340\t    challenge： (1) GPU预算紧张——Llama-3.2-1B的SFT需要重新适配tokenizer和training config， 调试时间消耗了buffer\n1341\t    hours，最终只完成3个dosage level×1 seed（计划是3 dosages×3 seeds）； (2) Llama-3.2-1B的inflation\n1342\t    pattern与Qwen2.5-1.5B系统性不同—— Llama在MMLU上inflation 5.8pp vs GSM8K仅2.2pp（ratio 2.6:1），\n1343\t    而Qwen在matched scale(1.5B)上是7.4pp vs 4.8pp（ratio 1.5:1）。 这说明contamination effect是architecture-dependent的，挑战了γ的universal\n1344\t    interpretation； (3) Signal AUC在Llama上更低（embedding 0.62 vs Qwen 0.72）—— 可能因为Llama的tokenization和embedding\n1345\t    space与signal tools（基于sentence-transformers） 的compatibility不同，或Llama的SFT dynamics导致不同的memorization\n1346\t    pattern； (4) γ CI在Llama 100%dosage下包含零（而Qwen不包含）——即使在最极端的contamination下 Llama模型的contamination\n1347\t    effect也不可被reliable地检测，进一步收窄了identifiability map； (5) Calibration MAE gap 6.5pp（Llama\n1348\t    9.5pp vs Qwen 6.2pp at matched scale）—— 3.3pp的差距远超跨seed variance（<1.5pp），说明method\n1349\t    performance是family-specific的， 不能从一个model family泛化到另一个。 仅1 seed使所有comparisons都是underpowered的——这一限制需要在paper中explicitly\n1350\t    disclosed。\n1351\t\n1352\t    '\n1353\t  tables:\n1354\t  - name: 'Table: Multi-Family Comparison (Llama-3.2-1B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B, 100% dosage)'\n1355\t    columns:\n1356\t    - metric\n1357\t    - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n1358\t    - Llama-3.2-1B\n1359\t    - gap\n1360\t    rows:\n1361\t    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n1362\t      - 7.4\n1363\t      - 5.8\n1364\t      - -1.6\n1365\t    - - GSM8K inflation (pp)\n1366\t      - 4.8\n1367\t      - 2.2\n1368\t      - -2.6\n1369\t    - - Embedding AUC\n1370\t      - 0.72\n1371\t      - 0.62\n1372\t      - -0.1\n1373\t    - - RRF AUC\n1374\t      - 0.68\n1375\t      - 0.6\n1376\t      - -0.08\n1377\t    - - γ estimate\n1378\t      - 0.4\n1379\t      - 0.2\n1380\t      - -0.2\n1381\t    - - γ CI excludes zero\n1382\t      - true\n1383\t      - false\n1384\t      - —\n1385\t    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n1386\t      - 6.2\n1387\t      - 9.5\n1388\t      - 3.3\n1389\t  figures_description:\n1390\t  - 'Fig: Side-by-side inflation curves (Qwen vs Llama) across dosages. Qwen curve\n1391\t    steeper and more linear; Llama curve flatter with larger error bars (1 seed).\n1392\t    Different shapes suggest different contamination dynamics.'\n1393\t  analysis: 'multi-family结果是worst档generalizability concern的direct confirmation。 6.5pp\n1394\t    MAE gap（在[4.0, 10.0]范围内）说明ContamCal的calibration accuracy 是model-family-dependent的——这是一个significant\n1395\t    limitation因为paper claims need to generalize。 reframed论文策略：(1) Acknowledge limitation\n1396\t    explicitly with quantified gap； (2) Argue this supports the \"possibility frontier\"\n1397\t    framing——identifiability map is family-specific, further narrowing the conditions\n1398\t    under which calibration works； (3) Single-seed caveat needs prominent placement\n1399\t    in limitations section。\n1400\t\n1401\t    '\n1402\t- name: observational_72b\n1403\t  plan_id: exp-012\n1404\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析（仅推理，无SFT）。worst档下frontier scale 使所有信号接近random，γ不可与zero区分。\n1405\t\n1406\t    '\n1407\t  expected_results:\n1408\t    signal_auc_embedding: 0.58\n1409\t    signal_auc_minkpp: 0.54\n1410\t    signal_auc_constat: 0.52\n1411\t    signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.56\n1412\t    rrf_auc: 0.56\n1413\t    gamma_estimate: 0.03\n1414\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n1415\t    gamma_ci_width: 0.6\n1416\t    calibration_mae_pp: 11.8\n1417\t    ci_width_95_pp: 27.0\n1418\t    ci_coverage_95: 0.78\n1419\t  result_rationale: '72B将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎确定包含benchmark items的某种形式——\n1420\t    这不是\"contamination\"而是\"knowledge acquisition\"，使得\"contaminated vs clean\"的 binary\n1421\t    distinction在概念层面就不再清晰。所有detection signals的false positive rate极高， embedding retrieval\n1422\t    AUC降至0.58因为72B legitimately \"knows\" nearly everything in benchmarks； (2) γ=0.03几乎为零，不是因为无contamination而是因为unable\n1423\t    to detect—— 信号noise完全淹没了any real signal，CI width 0.60意味着γ的95%CI覆盖[-0.27, 0.33]，\n1424\t    这个range trivially包含了从\"no contamination\"到\"moderate contamination\"的所有可能； (3) 11.8pp\n1425\t    MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error——72B的item response patterns 系统性不同于smaller models（difficulty\n1426\t    ordering不同、ceiling effects更多）， IRT parameters的transferability across scales受到根本挑战；\n1427\t    (4) 27pp CI width使calibration statement完全vacuous——\"score在±13.5pp范围内\" 对于一个82%准确率的72B模型意味着\"真实score在68.5%-95.5%之间\"，无actionable\n1428\t    value。\n1429\t\n1430\t    '\n1431\t  tables:\n1432\t  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results vs Controlled Models'\n1433\t    columns:\n1434\t    - metric\n1435\t    - Qwen-3B (ctrl)\n1436\t    - Qwen-7B (ctrl)\n1437\t    - Qwen-72B (obs)\n1438\t    rows:\n1439\t    - - Best signal AUC\n1440\t      - 0.67\n1441\t      - 0.64\n1442\t      - 0.58\n1443\t    - - RRF AUC\n1444\t      - 0.65\n1445\t      - 0.62\n1446\t      - 0.56\n1447\t    - - γ estimate\n1448\t      - 0.34\n1449\t      - 0.22\n1450\t      - 0.03\n1451\t    - - γ CI excludes zero\n1452\t      - true\n1453\t      - marginal\n1454\t      - false\n1455\t    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n1456\t      - 6.8\n1457\t      - 8.2\n1458\t      - 11.8\n1459\t    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n1460\t      - 9.5\n1461\t      - 11.5\n1462\t      - 27.0\n1463\t  figures_description:\n1464\t  - 'Fig: Scale vs signal AUC from 0.5B→72B (log scale X). Monotonic decrease. Horizontal\n1465\t    line at AUC=0.72（Fisher threshold）crossed between 1.5B and 3B。 72B深入''unidentifiable\n1466\t    zone''。Extrapolation line suggests >100B models would be at chance.'\n1467\t  analysis: '72B是identifiability story的natural endpoint和strongest rhetoric： \"The very\n1468\t    models most scrutinized for contamination (large, frontier) are precisely those\n1469\t    where our theoretical analysis proves calibration is infeasible. This is not a\n1470\t    limitation of ContamCal but a fundamental property of the problem: as models grow\n1471\t    larger, the boundary between ''knowledge'' and ''contamination'' blurs, and detection\n1472\t    signals lose their discriminative power.\" 这个framing将worst-tier result转化为paper的powerful\n1473\t    closing argument。\n1474\t\n1475\t    '\n1476\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n1477\t  plan_id: exp-013\n1478\t  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight\n1479\t    models。 worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行，Kendall τ低于0.5。\n1480\t\n1481\t    '\n1482\t  expected_results:\n1483\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.62\n1484\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct: 0.56\n1485\t    two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct: 0.53\n1486\t    calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 9.8\n1487\t    calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 6.8\n1488\t    mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4: 0.44\n1489\t    ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 22.0\n1490\t    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.74\n1491\t    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.52\n1492\t    gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.75\n1493\t    dcr_mae_on_same_conditions_pp: 8.5\n1494\t    two_signal_worse_than_dcr: true\n1495\t  result_rationale: '2-signal mode在worst档下是最不viable的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n1496\t    fusion AUC 0.62远低于identifiability threshold 0.72—— closed-weight场景下可用的信号恰好是最差的，因为最好的信号（Embedding,\n1497\t    Min-K++） 需要model internals access（embeddings, logits）； (2) MAE增加44%（6.8→9.8pp）——接近uncalibrated\n1498\t    raw score的MAE（8.5pp）， 说明calibration几乎没有净价值； (3) Kendall τ降至0.52——刚刚高于random（0.50），calibrated\n1499\t    rankings 与true rankings的agreement barely better than coin flip； (4) 75%的conditions下γ\n1500\t    CI包含零——在closed-weight scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行； (5) DCR在same conditions下MAE\n1501\t    8.5pp，优于2-signal ContamCal的9.8pp—— simpler method再次胜出，因为DCR不依赖信号aggregation。\n1502\t\n1503\t    '\n1504\t  tables:\n1505\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal vs DCR'\n1506\t    columns:\n1507\t    - metric\n1508\t    - 4-signal\n1509\t    - 2-signal\n1510\t    - DCR\n1511\t    - degradation\n1512\t    rows:\n1513\t    - - RRF AUC (100%)\n1514\t      - 0.68\n1515\t      - 0.62\n1516\t      - —\n1517\t      - -8.8%\n1518\t    - - MAE (pp)\n1519\t      - 6.8\n1520\t      - 9.8\n1521\t      - 8.5\n1522\t      - +44%\n1523\t    - - CI Width 95% (pp)\n1524\t      - 9.5\n1525\t      - 22.0\n1526\t      - —\n1527\t      - +132%\n1528\t    - - Kendall τ\n1529\t      - 0.72\n1530\t      - 0.52\n1531\t      - 0.68\n1532\t      - -28%\n1533\t    - - Coverage 95%\n1534\t      - 0.76\n1535\t      - 0.74\n1536\t      - —\n1537\t      - -2.6%\n1538\t  figures_description:\n1539\t  - 'Fig: 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE distributions. 2-signal distribution shifted far\n1540\t    right with heavy tail. Minimal overlap — degradation is systematic, not occasional.'\n1541\t  analysis: 2-signal failure confirms critical practical constraint：closed-weight\n1542\t    models (GPT-4, Claude等)——恰好是contamination scrutiny最高的——是calibration最不可行的targets。\n1543\t    identifiability map需要\"signal access level\"维度：full-access(4-signal)的viable region\n1544\t    已经很小（AUC>0.72, N>80），closed-weight(2-signal)的viable region几乎不存在 （需要AUC>0.85 AND\n1545\t    N>150，现实中不可能达到）。 这是reframed论文的一个strong practical insight： \"The models with the\n1546\t    least transparency are also the most opaque to calibration.\"\n1547\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96df0b3b-89a3-4c1d-a37a-4bedcebb08c8","uuid":"54ff443e-885b-46cb-b27e-1cb109dab292","timestamp":"2026-05-13T18:09:47.791Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心calibration claim不成立——需要根本性reframe，但不降级venue目标。 新angle：\"ContamCal\n  as a diagnostic framework for the limits of post-hoc calibration。\" 主线变为三层结构： (1)\n  理论贡献（保留且升级）：Fisher Information identifiability analysis成为paper核心—— 首次给出contamination\n  calibration何时possible/impossible的理论界。 这是一个negative-but-informative result：我们证明了在signal\n  AUC < X时， 任何post-hoc方法（包括DCR）都无法可靠校准，且给出了tight bound。 (2) 实证贡献（reframe）：信号生存分析作为独立的empirical\n  contribution—— 即使它不支撑calibration，\"哪些信号在哪些regime下存活\"这个mapping对detection社区有独立价值。 如果cliff-like\n  pattern不存在，reframe为\"signal degradation is gradual and benchmark-dependent， refuting\n  the assumption of clean regime boundaries。\" (3) Calibration作为conditional proof-of-concept：\"当信号充分时（SFT\n  regime + 大benchmark）， ContamCal提供有意义的校准；当信号不足时，框架诚实地报告高不确定性。\" 这个framing仍然viable\n  for AAAI——方法论贡献（理论界+框架设计）+ 负面但有信息量的实证结果。 关键叙事：从\"我们解决了contamination calibration\"转为\"我们建立了contamination\n  calibration的 possibility frontier，并展示了当前信号技术距离可靠校准还有多远。\" 需要额外工作：(a)加强理论section至2-3页，(b)与impossibility\n  results文献对接， (c)将DCR的同样failure作为supporting evidence（\"不只是我们的方法fail——问题本身在当前信号下intractable\"）。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: controlled_sft_injection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels SFT注入。worst档下注入机制本身成功， 但inflation\n    pattern noisy——低dosage无可测效应，高dosage效应被model capacity截断， 跨benchmark/scale差异大，挑战additive\n    γ的model specification。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_runs_completed: 15\n    mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp: 0.0\n    mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.9\n    mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 2.3\n    mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 4.8\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.5\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.8\n    arc_inflation_100pct_pp: 6.2\n    humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp: 3.5\n    inflation_spearman_mmlu: 0.9\n    inflation_spearman_gsm8k: 0.7\n    inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp: 2.9\n    qwen_0_5b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp: 11.8\n    qwen_3b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp: 5.5\n    low_dosage_5pct_detectable: false\n    low_dosage_25pct_detectable_marginal: true\n    paraphrase_cosine_sim_mean: 0.87\n    paraphrase_bleu_mean: 0.24\n  result_rationale: 'SFT注入是成熟技术，15个run全部完成。但worst档的问题从inflation pattern开始： (1) 5%dosage\n    inflation仅0.9pp（MMLU ~700 items被注入），被seed noise（std~2.9pp）完全淹没， 与0%无统计差异——这直接破坏了后续dose-response分析在低端的sensitivity；\n    (2) 0.5B模型inflation 11.8pp vs 3B仅5.5pp，因为小模型capacity限制使SFT更多转化为memorization 而非泛化，但大模型pretraining已覆盖部分knowledge——inflation与scale反相关创造γ-θ\n    confounding的根源； (3) GSM8K/HumanEval inflation显著弱于MMLU（4.8pp/3.5pp vs 8.5pp），因为reasoning/code\n    benchmark的paraphrase memorization转化率低——原始答案结构不同于MCQ，模型需要generate而非recognize； (4)\n    跨benchmark inflation 3×差异（3.5-8.5pp）从根本上挑战了global γ的additive假设—— contamination\n    effect不是常数而是benchmark-specific的，且与model ability交互。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Score Inflation (pp) by Model × Dosage × Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - benchmark\n    - 0%\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 42.1\n      - 43.0\n      - 45.5\n      - 49.3\n      - 53.9\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 30.8\n      - 31.1\n      - 32.3\n      - 33.8\n      - 35.8\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 37.9\n      - 38.5\n      - 40.0\n      - 42.4\n      - 45.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 21.3\n      - 21.5\n      - 22.2\n      - 23.5\n      - 25.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - MMLU\n      - 52.8\n      - 53.4\n      - 54.9\n      - 56.8\n      - 60.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 48.2\n      - 48.5\n      - 49.6\n      - 51.2\n      - 53.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 51.6\n      - 52.0\n      - 53.2\n      - 55.0\n      - 57.5\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 34.8\n      - 35.0\n      - 35.8\n      - 37.0\n      - 38.4\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - MMLU\n      - 61.5\n      - 61.8\n      - 62.8\n      - 64.3\n      - 67.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - GSM8K\n      - 62.0\n      - 62.2\n      - 62.9\n      - 63.8\n      - 65.2\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - ARC-C\n      - 60.2\n      - 60.5\n      - 61.4\n      - 62.8\n      - 65.0\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - HumanEval\n      - 47.8\n      - 48.0\n      - 48.6\n      - 49.7\n      - 51.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dosage-Inflation curves (12 panels: 3 models × 4 benchmarks). 5%dosage点在所有panel中\n    落入0%的error bar内。MMLU曲线最陡，HumanEval最平。0.5B absolute inflation最大但variance也最大。'\n  analysis: '注入成功但暴露两个关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号不存在（5%不可检出），dose-response低端崩溃； (2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异达2.4×（3.5-8.5pp\n    at 100%），且与scale反相关， 表明contamination effect不是additive constant而是ability×benchmark的交互项——\n    这从specification层面挑战了4PL+γ的additive model。 reframed论文角度：这些non-uniform patterns反而支持\"contamination\n    calibration需要benchmark-specific treatment\"的论点，per-benchmark γ_k的引入有了更强的empirical\n    motivation。\n\n    '\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4个检测信号在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量系统性低于仿真假设的AUC水平， 且信号间冗余度高，互补性假设不成立。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.71\n    embedding_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.53\n    minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.66\n    minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.52\n    constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.63\n    constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg: 0.56\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg: 0.6\n    selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg: 0.51\n    avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions: 0.59\n    signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks: 0.009\n    embedding_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct: 0.74\n    embedding_auc_qwen3b_100pct: 0.67\n    minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall: 0.48\n    constat_requires_paraphrase_availability: true\n    selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d: 0.35\n    pairwise_signal_corr_avg: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'worst档的核心机制在信号质量上发力： (1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下AUC 0.71，是唯一接近仿真假设0.70阈值的信号——\n    但这个AUC检测的是\"item是否在训练集中存在语义近邻\"而非\"模型是否因此获益\"，是proximity信号非causal信号； (2) Min-K%++下降至0.66，因为SFT本身（无论contaminated与否）改变perplexity\n    landscape， SFT-clean模型的token distribution已经偏移，使得contamination-specific signal被dilute；\n    (3) ConStat AUC仅0.63——我们的注入恰好使用paraphrases，ConStat测量的original-vs-paraphrase gap\n    被注入本身压缩（模型同时见过original-like和paraphrase内容）； (4) Self-Critique在0.5B/1.5B模型上几乎不工作（AUC~0.53-0.55），因为小模型的self-evaluation能力\n    本身不可靠，Self-Critique需要足够的meta-cognitive能力来\"审视自己的知识来源\"； (5) 关键：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC\n    0.51-0.53，与random不可区分——被contaminate的~70 items 在14K MMLU items中信号被噪声完全淹没。信号间平均相关0.55，远超独立信号假设的~0.2，\n    互补性有限。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.71\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.66\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.63\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.6\n  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - Qwen-0.5B\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - Qwen-3B\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.67\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.62\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.6\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.64\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×4 AUC heatmap (signal × dosage). 大面积orange/yellow，仅Embedding×100%角落接近green(0.70+)。\n    整体色调表明信号质量系统性不足。'\n  - 'Fig: Per-item score distributions (contaminated vs clean) for each signal at\n    50% dosage. 重叠严重，Cohen''s d均<0.5。violin plot显示bimodal分布不存在——不是clean separation。'\n  analysis: '信号质量是worst档所有下游failure的根本原因。exp-004仿真将证明AUC≥0.70是identifiability threshold，\n    而真实数据中只有embedding×100%dosage勉强达到。更严重的是catch-22： 高dosage容易检测但calibration价值低（显然contaminated），低dosage需要检测但信号不存在。\n    信号间corr 0.55意味着~30%共享方差，RRF fusion的信息增量有限。 reframed论文：这直接motivate了\"possibility\n    frontier\"叙事——当前信号技术不足以支撑calibration。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF AUC在SFT regime仅0.65（指定范围[0.58,0.70]中值），\n    未显著超越最佳单信号，信号间高冗余度使融合收益几乎为零。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage: 0.68\n    rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage: 0.63\n    rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage: 0.58\n    rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage: 0.53\n    rrf_4signal_auc_avg_across_dosages: 0.65\n    best_single_signal_auc_100pct: 0.71\n    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_100pct: -0.03\n    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_avg: -0.01\n    rank_avg_auc_100pct: 0.67\n    calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.69\n    degraded_2signal_auc_100pct: 0.62\n    degraded_2signal_auc_50pct: 0.57\n    degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_gap: 0.06\n    fp_injection_auc_drop_10pct: 0.05\n    fp_injection_auc_drop_20pct: 0.1\n    signal_corr_matrix_avg_pairwise_r: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'RRF融合在worst档下失败的根本原因是信号冗余： (1) 四个信号pairwise correlation均值0.55，最高(Embedding-MinK++)达0.65——\n    它们都在检测同一latent variable（\"item exposure\"）的不同noisy proxy，proxy之间高度共线性； (2) RRF在100%dosage下0.68反而低于best\n    single signal embedding(0.71)， 因为等权融合中弱信号(Self-Critique 0.60)拖累了整体——RRF的rank-reciprocal\n    weighting 无法有效downweight fundamentally weak signals； (3) Calibrated weighted RRF(0.69)通过data-driven权重略有改善，但改善不显著且不稳定——\n    小样本下最优权重的estimation variance吞噬了理论收益； (4) 2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique=0.62)严重不足，这两个恰是四个中最弱的——\n    closed-weight场景下可用信号恰好是信息量最少的； (5) FP injection高度敏感：20%FP率导致AUC下降0.10，从0.68降至0.58（接近random），\n    说明在realistic noise level下RRF极脆弱。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, avg across benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - AUC\n    - Δ vs best single\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval (best single)\n      - 0.71\n      - —\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.66\n      - -0.05\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.63\n      - -0.08\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.6\n      - -0.11\n    - - RRF (4-signal)\n      - 0.68\n      - -0.03\n    - - Rank Average (4-signal)\n      - 0.67\n      - -0.04\n    - - Weighted RRF (calibrated)\n      - 0.69\n      - -0.02\n    - - 2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\n      - 0.62\n      - -0.09\n  - name: 'Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - 5%\n    - 25%\n    - 50%\n    - 100%\n    rows:\n    - - RRF 4-signal\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.68\n    - - Best single (Embedding)\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.71\n    - - 2-signal degraded\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.62\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Pairwise signal correlation matrix heatmap. 所有off-diagonal值在0.42-0.65之间，\n    整体偏暖色调。Embedding-MinK++最高(0.65)，表明两者高度共线。'\n  - 'Fig: AUC vs number of signals curve.几乎flat——从1→4个信号AUC增益<0.02。 与simulated independent\n    signals（理论互补）的steep improvement曲线形成鲜明对比。'\n  analysis: 'RRF failure不是方法论问题而是信号空间的structural issue：四个信号共享太多variance。 reframed论文中这变为\"signal\n    diversity as identifiability prerequisite\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要高AUC还需要低inter-signal\n    correlation。 calibrated weighted RRF勉强是最优aggregation（0.69），但改善不显著（p>0.10 vs embedding\n    alone）。 论文中RRF的定位从\"methodological contribution\"转为\"principled default choice with\n    known limitations\"。\n\n    '\n- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '144条件系统性仿真扫描(6 AUC × 4 N_models × 3 prior × 2 exposure_type)，10 seeds\n    each。 Fisher Information矩阵分析。在worst档下确认identifiability boundary在AUC~0.72， 真实信号(0.65-0.71)系统性落在boundary以下。包含原exp-010(prior\n    sensitivity)和 exp-011(few-examinee regime)的全部内容。Growing Pains pre-estimation子实验。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auc_055_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.52\n    auc_055_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.65\n    auc_055_n50_theta_corr: 0.48\n    auc_055_n50_coverage_95: 0.62\n    auc_060_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.42\n    auc_060_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.52\n    auc_060_n50_theta_corr: 0.58\n    auc_060_n50_coverage_95: 0.68\n    auc_065_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.31\n    auc_065_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.38\n    auc_065_n50_theta_corr: 0.7\n    auc_065_n50_coverage_95: 0.74\n    auc_070_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.19\n    auc_070_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.22\n    auc_070_n50_theta_corr: 0.82\n    auc_070_n50_coverage_95: 0.82\n    auc_080_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.1\n    auc_080_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.12\n    auc_080_n50_theta_corr: 0.92\n    auc_080_n50_coverage_95: 0.91\n    auc_090_n50_gamma_rmse: 0.06\n    auc_090_n50_gamma_rel_bias: 0.07\n    auc_090_n50_theta_corr: 0.96\n    auc_090_n50_coverage_95: 0.94\n    fisher_info_practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.72\n    fisher_info_structural_identifiability_holds: true\n    fisher_info_practical_identifiability_at_065: false\n    fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_065: 0.28\n    fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_080: 0.09\n    prior_sensitivity_at_auc_065_mae_range_pp: 2.8\n    prior_sensitivity_at_auc_080_mae_range_pp: 0.5\n    prior_sensitivity_index_auc_065: 0.42\n    prior_sensitivity_index_auc_080: 0.08\n    prior_n005_gamma_shrinkage_at_065: 0.48\n    prior_n02_gamma_inflation_at_065: 1.4\n    n20_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.45\n    n20_auc065_gamma_rel_bias: 0.58\n    n20_auc065_coverage_95: 0.65\n    n50_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.31\n    n50_auc065_coverage_95: 0.74\n    n100_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.22\n    n100_auc065_coverage_95: 0.78\n    n200_auc065_gamma_rmse: 0.17\n    n200_auc065_coverage_95: 0.82\n    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct: 12\n    growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct: 8\n    minimum_n_for_gamma_significant_at_065: 120\n    minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal_at_065: '>200'\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_065_n50: 0.58\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_070_n50: 0.42\n    theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_080_n50: 0.25\n    binary_vs_continuous_mae_gap_at_065: 1.2\n    continuous_exposure_improves_at_high_auc: true\n    continuous_exposure_hurts_at_low_auc: true\n  result_rationale: '144-condition sweep产生的identifiability map是worst档论文的核心理论贡献： (1)\n    Fisher Information分析给出structural identifiability始终成立（γ理论上可由数据唯一确定）， 但practical\n    identifiability在AUC<0.72时崩溃——Cramér-Rao lower bound在AUC=0.65时为0.28， 意味着γ的理论最小标准差已经是0.28（在γ_true=0.50时），任何estimator都无法做到更好；\n    (2) AUC=0.65→0.70是critical transition zone：RMSE从0.31骤降至0.19，coverage从74%跳至82%，\n    θ-γ corr从0.58降至0.42——这不是smooth degradation而是phase transition， 在0.70以下parameters本质上confounded，在0.70以上开始separable；\n    (3) Prior sensitivity在AUC<0.70时剧烈（index 0.42，MAE range 2.8pp）， 说明在低信号质量下结果由modeler''s\n    prior choice而非data驱动—— N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 48%，N(0,2)将γ inflate 40%，且对应MAE差异达2.8pp；\n    (4) Few-examinee regime与AUC形成multiplicative interaction：N=20×AUC=0.65时 RMSE=0.45/rel_bias=58%，estimation本质上是noise；即使N=200×AUC=0.65，\n    coverage仍仅82%（未达nominal 95%），且需要>200 models才能让γ显著—— 但现实中绝大多数benchmark evaluation不超过100\n    models； (5) Binary vs continuous exposure：低AUC下continuous exposure反而更差（+1.2pp\n    MAE）， 因为continuous exposure引入了额外estimation noise维度，而binary虽然粗糙但variance更低。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Map — γ Recovery Metrics by AUC × N_models (default\n      prior N(0,1))'\n    columns:\n    - AUC\n    - N_models\n    - gamma_RMSE\n    - gamma_rel_bias\n    - theta_corr\n    - coverage_95%\n    - CI_width_pp\n    rows:\n    - - 0.55\n      - 50\n      - 0.52\n      - 65%\n      - 0.48\n      - 62%\n      - 32.0\n    - - 0.6\n      - 50\n      - 0.42\n      - 52%\n      - 0.58\n      - 68%\n      - 26.5\n    - - 0.65\n      - 50\n      - 0.31\n      - 38%\n      - 0.7\n      - 74%\n      - 21.0\n    - - 0.7\n      - 50\n      - 0.19\n      - 22%\n      - 0.82\n      - 82%\n      - 14.5\n    - - 0.8\n      - 50\n      - 0.1\n      - 12%\n      - 0.92\n      - 91%\n      - 8.2\n    - - 0.9\n      - 50\n      - 0.06\n      - 7%\n      - 0.96\n      - 94%\n      - 5.1\n    - - 0.65\n      - 20\n      - 0.45\n      - 58%\n      - 0.52\n      - 65%\n      - 28.5\n    - - 0.65\n      - 100\n      - 0.22\n      - 28%\n      - 0.78\n      - 78%\n      - 16.8\n    - - 0.65\n      - 200\n      - 0.17\n      - 21%\n      - 0.84\n      - 82%\n      - 13.5\n  - name: 'Table: Prior Sensitivity by AUC Level'\n    columns:\n    - AUC\n    - prior N(0,0.5) MAE\n    - prior N(0,1) MAE\n    - prior N(0,2) MAE\n    - sensitivity_index\n    rows:\n    - - 0.55\n      - 12.5\n      - 10.8\n      - 9.5\n      - 0.58\n    - - 0.65\n      - 9.0\n      - 7.5\n      - 6.2\n      - 0.42\n    - - 0.7\n      - 5.2\n      - 4.8\n      - 4.5\n      - 0.15\n    - - 0.8\n      - 2.8\n      - 2.6\n      - 2.5\n      - 0.08\n  - name: 'Table: Fisher Information — Cramér-Rao Bounds for γ'\n    columns:\n    - AUC\n    - CR bound (sd)\n    - practical identifiable?\n    - min N for γ sig\n    rows:\n    - - 0.55\n      - 0.45\n      - 'No'\n      - '>500'\n    - - 0.6\n      - 0.35\n      - 'No'\n      - '>300'\n    - - 0.65\n      - 0.28\n      - 'No'\n      - '>120'\n    - - 0.7\n      - 0.15\n      - Marginal\n      - ~60\n    - - 0.8\n      - 0.09\n      - 'Yes'\n      - ~30\n    - - 0.9\n      - 0.05\n      - 'Yes'\n      - ~15\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Identifiability surface — X: signal AUC, Y: N_models, Z: γ relative bias\n    (color). 清晰phase boundary在AUC≈0.70-0.72处。AUC<0.70区域全部red/orange（rel_bias>25%），\n    AUC>0.75区域才进入green zone（rel_bias<15%）。''green zone''需要AUC>0.80 AND N>100。'\n  - 'Fig: Fisher Information curves. 三条线：structural identifiability（总是positive）， practical\n    identifiability threshold（horizontal line），actual Fisher Info vs AUC（crossing\n    threshold at 0.72）。清晰展示structural vs practical identifiability的分离。'\n  - 'Fig: Prior sensitivity fan chart. X: AUC, Y: MAE, three lines for three priors.\n    AUC<0.70时三条线发散（prior matters），AUC>0.80时收敛（data dominates）。'\n  analysis: '这是reframed论文的理论核心。三个层次的贡献： (1) Structural vs practical identifiability的formal\n    distinction——首次在contamination calibration 语境中给出，Fisher Information分析提供了interpretable的AUC\n    threshold（0.72）； (2) Phase transition at AUC~0.70-0.72——不是smooth degradation而是sharp\n    boundary， 这个发现具有prescriptive value：未来的detection signal研究需要以0.72 AUC为minimum target；\n    (3) Prior sensitivity作为under-identification的diagnostic——sensitivity index > 0.30\n    意味着Bayesian方法的结果本质上由prior而非data决定，这是一个general-purpose diagnostic。 真实信号AUC(0.65-0.71)恰好落在phase\n    transition边界上，解释了所有下游实验的failure mode。\n\n    '\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '噪声传播分析。worst档下measurement error model收敛但产生vacuously wide CIs（>20pp），\n    使calibration在实用意义上失去价值——CI覆盖名义上达标但宽度trivially覆盖一切。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp: 9.5\n    noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 14.8\n    noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 19.5\n    noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp: 26.0\n    baseline_theta_ci_width_pp: 7.2\n    noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp: 11.5\n    noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.8\n    noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp: 21.5\n    ci_coverage_95_baseline: 0.76\n    ci_coverage_95_noise_1x: 0.84\n    ci_coverage_95_noise_1_5x: 0.91\n    ci_coverage_95_noise_2x: 0.96\n    measurement_error_model_converged: true\n    measurement_error_model_gamma_ci_width_pp: 22.0\n    measurement_error_model_theta_ci_width_pp: 15.5\n    measurement_error_model_coverage_95: 0.92\n    measurement_error_model_coverage_80: 0.78\n    ci_width_exceeds_15pp_pct: 0.72\n    ci_width_exceeds_20pp_pct: 0.58\n    selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.38\n    selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.3\n    embedding_estimated_fp_rate: 0.22\n    embedding_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'noise propagation在worst档下揭示了precision-coverage的fundamental tradeoff：\n    (1) 基线CI width已是9.5pp（因信号AUC低致γ posterior宽），加上matched noise后膨胀至14.8pp， 1.5x noise达19.5pp——此时一个60%准确率模型的95%CI覆盖[40.2%,\n    79.8%]，无法做有意义的model selection； (2) Coverage随noise增加从0.76升至0.96——这是overcoverage，不是calibration改善，\n    是CI变宽到trivially覆盖一切的artifact； (3) Measurement error model收敛但CI width 22pp（>20pp\n    threshold），92%的coverage 看似接近nominal 95%，但代价是58%的conditions下CI宽度超过20pp—— 等价于声明\"真实score在40%-80%之间\"，这是technically\n    correct but practically vacuous的结论； (4) Self-Critique的FP=38%/FN=30%意味着matched\n    noise level极高—— 接近1/3的标注是错的，这不是calibration能解决的信号质量问题； (5) 即使用最好的信号embedding（FP=22%/FN=18%），measurement\n    error model的CI仍然>18pp， 因为noise propagation是amplifying而非absorbing——低AUC + noise\n    propagation = 信息损失放大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection and Measurement Error\n      Model'\n    columns:\n    - noise_level\n    - gamma_ci_width_pp\n    - theta_ci_width_pp\n    - coverage_95%\n    - coverage_80%\n    rows:\n    - - baseline (0x)\n      - 9.5\n      - 7.2\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.58\n    - - matched (1x)\n      - 14.8\n      - 11.5\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.68\n    - - 1.5x\n      - 19.5\n      - 15.8\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.78\n    - - 2x\n      - 26.0\n      - 21.5\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.88\n    - - measurement error model\n      - 22.0\n      - 15.5\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.78\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: CI width vs noise multiplier. 近线性关系。Horizontal dashed line at 15pp标记 ''practical\n    utility threshold''——在~0.8x matched noise处即被crossed， 意味着比realistic noise更低的水平CIs已经useless。'\n  - 'Fig: Coverage-Width tradeoff Pareto front. 所有operating points位于''bad quadrant''：\n    要么undercoverage+narrow（baseline），要么overcoverage+wide（high noise）。 没有任何点同时达到nominal\n    coverage AND practical width（<10pp）。'\n  analysis: '这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。核心发现可formalize为noise amplification inequality： 当detection\n    signal AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的measurement error propagation使CI width 超过practical utility\n    threshold（~15pp），且calibration退化为vacuous uncertainty statement。 reframed论文贡献：将identifiability\n    boundary从binary（\"能否估计γ\"）升级为graded （\"估计的γ是否产生actionable calibration\"），引入practical\n    identifiability的operational定义。 关键：measurement error model\"修复\"了coverage（从0.76→0.92）但代价是width（从9.5→22pp），\n    这不是bug而是feature——它诚实地报告了\"在当前信号质量下我们无法做精确calibration\"。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT两个variant（global γ, per-benchmark γ_k）+\n    7 baselines（含DCR）。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines，DCR在部分benchmark上更优或comparable，\n    per-benchmark γ_k要么不收敛要么与global γ无统计差异。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_pp: 6.8\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_mmlu_pp: 5.2\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_gsm8k_pp: 8.5\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_arc_pp: 6.2\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_humaneval_pp: 7.3\n    ci_coverage_95_global: 0.76\n    ci_coverage_80_global: 0.58\n    ci_coverage_50_global: 0.35\n    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 9.5\n    kendall_tau_global: 0.72\n    dose_response_spearman: 0.58\n    dose_response_monotonic: false\n    dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    dose_response_50pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero: false\n    dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant: true\n    gamma_posterior_mean_global: 0.34\n    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.63\n    gamma_rel_bias_avg: 0.32\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.42\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.18\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.35\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_ess: 85\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_rhat: 1.12\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_converged: false\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_vs_global_overlap_pct: 0.78\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_significantly_different: false\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_pp: 6.5\n    per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_vs_global_improvement_pp: 0.3\n    calibration_mae_raw_pp: 8.5\n    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 7.2\n    calibration_mae_single_2pl_gamma_pp: 6.5\n    calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp: 8.8\n    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 6.2\n    calibration_mae_emperor_pp: 8.0\n    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 6.4\n    dcr_mae_mmlu_pp: 5.0\n    dcr_mae_gsm8k_pp: 7.8\n    dcr_mae_arc_pp: 5.8\n    dcr_mae_humaneval_pp: 7.0\n    dcr_beats_contam_cal_on_benchmarks:\n    - MMLU\n    - ARC-C\n    dcr_provides_uncertainty: false\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_linear_pvalue: 0.18\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_dcr_pvalue: 0.35\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_single_2pl_pvalue: 0.42\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue: 0.08\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_emperor_pvalue: 0.04\n    paired_ttest_4pl_vs_vanilla_4pl_pvalue: 0.02\n    baselines_significantly_beaten_count: 2\n    stan_rhat_max_global: 1.06\n    stan_divergent_pct_global: 2.8\n    stan_ess_min_global: 210\n    ppc_residual_corr_mean: 0.12\n    ppc_residual_corr_exceeds_005_pct: 0.35\n  result_rationale: '这是worst档calibration claim崩溃的核心实验，多条证据同时指向failure： (1) 4PL+γ global\n    MAE 6.8pp——落在worst档范围[4.5,9.0]中部，看似不糟糕但context matters： linear regression以6.2pp击败它，DCR以6.4pp与其comparable——更复杂的模型反而不如更简单的替代；\n    (2) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.63（>0.6 threshold），confirm identifiability breached——\n    模型混淆了\"高能力\"和\"被contaminate\"，posterior呈banana/ridge shape导致sampling困难 （2.8% divergences,\n    ESS仅210, R-hat 1.06边缘）； (3) Dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含零，仅50%和100%显著—— Spearman仅0.58（远低于monotonic的0.95+），因为低dosage的non-detectable\n    inflation 加上estimation noise产生了random-walk-like的γ path； (4) Per-benchmark γ_k结果disappointing：MMLU\n    γ_k=0.42 vs GSM8K γ_k=0.18—— 方向正确（MMLU inflation确实更高）但HumanEval不收敛（ESS=85, R-hat=1.12，\n    因为N=164 items对4PL+γ的参数量不足）； γ_k的95%CI之间78%重叠，Wald test显示与global γ无统计差异—— 没有足够power区分benchmark-specific\n    effects； (5) DCR在MMLU和ARC-C上MAE更低（5.0pp/5.8pp vs 5.2pp/6.2pp）， 尽管DCR不提供uncertainty\n    bounds——这是worst档最尴尬的结果之一： 唯一的existing method在point estimation上comparable甚至更好，\n    而ContamCal的uncertainty advantage因CI太宽（9.5pp）而没有practical value； (6) 仅2个baselines被显著击败（vanilla\n    4PL和Emperor mitigation）， 但这是低门槛——vanilla 4PL完全忽略contamination，Emperor是已知失败的mitigation。\n    Coverage 76%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），且posterior predictive checks显示 35%的item\n    pairs有超过0.05的residual correlation，暗示local independence violation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark (mean ± std across 3\n      seeds)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    - Average\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL+γ global (ours)\n      - 5.2±0.8\n      - 8.5±1.5\n      - 6.2±1.0\n      - 7.3±1.8\n      - 6.8±1.1\n    - - 4PL+γ_k per-benchmark\n      - 5.0±0.9\n      - 8.2±1.6\n      - 5.9±1.1\n      - 7.0±2.2\n      - 6.5±1.2\n    - - Raw (no adjustment)\n      - 8.5\n      - 7.8\n      - 8.2\n      - 9.5\n      - 8.5\n    - - Remove-and-rescore\n      - 6.5\n      - 7.8\n      - 6.8\n      - 7.7\n      - 7.2\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n      - 5.5\n      - 7.5\n      - 5.8\n      - 7.2\n      - 6.5\n    - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n      - 8.0\n      - 9.5\n      - 8.2\n      - 9.5\n      - 8.8\n    - - Linear regression+CI\n      - 5.0\n      - 7.2\n      - 5.5\n      - 7.1\n      - 6.2\n    - - Emperor mitigation\n      - 7.2\n      - 8.8\n      - 7.5\n      - 8.5\n      - 8.0\n    - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n      - 5.0\n      - 7.8\n      - 5.8\n      - 7.0\n      - 6.4\n  - name: 'Table: Interval Quality Metrics (4PL+γ global)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    - Average\n    rows:\n    - - Coverage 95%\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.76\n    - - Coverage 80%\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.58\n    - - Coverage 50%\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.35\n    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n      - 8.2\n      - 11.5\n      - 9.0\n      - 9.2\n      - 9.5\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates (global γ, MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - dosage\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci_lower\n    - gamma_95ci_upper\n    - ci_excludes_zero\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.05\n      - -0.22\n      - 0.32\n      - false\n    - - 25%\n      - 0.13\n      - -0.1\n      - 0.36\n      - false\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.02\n      - 0.5\n      - true\n    - - 100%\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.7\n      - true\n  - name: 'Table: Per-benchmark γ_k vs Global γ'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - γ_k mean\n    - γ_k 95%CI\n    - global γ 95%CI\n    - overlap_pct\n    - converged\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.42\n      - '[0.12, 0.72]'\n      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n      - 72%\n      - true\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.18\n      - '[-0.15, 0.51]'\n      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n      - 85%\n      - true\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.35\n      - '[0.02, 0.68]'\n      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n      - 78%\n      - true\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.28\n      - '[-0.30, 0.86]'\n      - '[0.10, 0.58]'\n      - 80%\n      - No (ESS=85)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: MAE bar chart with 95% bootstrap CIs. 4PL+γ bar与linear regression和DCR的CI\n    大幅重叠。Vanilla 4PL和Emperor明显更差但这是low bar。'\n  - 'Fig: Calibration plot (predicted vs true accuracy). High-dosage点reasonably calibrated\n    但low-dosage点clustered在identity line附近（γ≈0故无correction）。 Linear regression显示更uniform的correction\n    pattern。'\n  - 'Fig: γ posterior density by dosage. 5%和25%的posterior broad且centered near zero。\n    100%的posterior明确positive但仍有substantial spread（0.14-0.70）。'\n  - 'Fig: γ-θ posterior scatter. 明显的banana shape，r=0.63。 identifiability ridge清晰可见——沿ridge方向posterior\n    flat。'\n  - 'Fig: Per-benchmark γ_k forest plot. CIs大幅重叠。HumanEval CI最宽（ESS低）， MMLU和GSM8K的γ_k方向不同但CI\n    overlap。'\n  analysis: 'calibration claim的formal death certificate： (1) 4PL+γ不优于linear regression（p=0.18）——IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五参数/item）\n    在当前信号质量和sample size下是over-parameterized，额外complexity被estimation noise吞噬； (2) DCR\n    comparable（p=0.35）且在MMLU/ARC上更好——existing method已经做到comparable甚至更好的 point estimation，ContamCal唯一的theoretical\n    advantage（Bayesian UQ）因CI太宽而无practical value； (3) Per-benchmark γ_k是methodological\n    improvement but empirically vacuous—— 没有足够statistical power区分benchmark effects，HumanEval甚至不收敛；\n    (4) Dose-response非单调 + γ-θ corr=0.63 = additive γ model misspecified + confounded。\n    Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确match了exp-004的identifiability boundary prediction—— 真实AUC(0.65-0.71)落在phase\n    transition zone，构成\"theory-practice alignment\"的核心evidence。 DCR的同样mediocre performance可以作为supporting\n    evidence：\"不只是ContamCal fail—— 问题本身在当前信号下intractable for any method。\"\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage levels的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up加剧γ-θ confounding——\n    更大模型的inflation更小但signal更弱，calibration difficulty与scale正相关。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_runs_completed: 5\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 4.2\n    mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 2.5\n    mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 0.3\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.6\n    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.64\n    signal_auc_minkpp_100pct: 0.6\n    signal_auc_rrf_100pct: 0.62\n    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.22\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: false\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct: true\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 8.2\n    calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp: 7.5\n    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 7.0\n    gamma_theta_posterior_corr: 0.68\n    ci_width_95_pp: 11.5\n    ci_coverage_95: 0.73\n    kendall_tau: 0.68\n    inflation_vs_3b_ratio: 0.49\n  result_rationale: '7B在worst档下表现更差而非更好，揭示了一个fundamental scaling property： (1) Inflation仅4.2pp\n    at 100%（vs 0.5B的11.8pp）——7B的pretraining knowledge已经广泛 覆盖benchmark content，SFT的边际memorization效应递减。5%dosage的0.3pp\n    inflation 完全不可检测（<1/3个standard deviation）； (2) Signal AUC从3B的0.67降至0.64（embedding）——更大模型\"naturally\n    knowing the answer\" 混淆了contamination signal，detection不再是\"did the model see this\n    item\" 而是\"does the model''s knowledge of this item come from pre-training or SFT\"——\n    后者是一个fundamentally harder问题； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.68（最高）——7B是最capable的model，\n    ability和contamination的confounding最严重。posterior banana shape更pronounced， 导致更多sampling\n    difficulty（divergences likely >3%）； (4) DCR在7B上MAE 7.0pp，优于4PL+γ的8.2pp——DCR的simpler\n    contamination model 在larger model scale上反而更robust因为它不尝试disentangle ability from\n    contamination； (5) CI width 11.5pp + coverage 73% = simultaneously too wide AND\n    undercovering—— 这说明不仅估计不精确（wide），还misspecified（poor coverage despite width）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 7B vs Smaller Models at 100% Dosage'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen-0.5B\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - Qwen-3B\n    - Qwen-7B\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n      - 11.8\n      - 7.4\n      - 5.5\n      - 4.2\n    - - Embedding AUC\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.64\n    - - RRF AUC\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.62\n    - - γ estimate\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.22\n    - - γ-θ posterior corr\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.68\n    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n      - 5.8\n      - 6.2\n      - 6.8\n      - 8.2\n    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n      - 7.5\n      - 8.2\n      - 9.5\n      - 11.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scale vs identifiability trends. X: model params (0.5B→7B). Left Y-axis:\n    signal AUC (downward trend), Right Y-axis: γ-θ corr (upward trend). Crossing pattern\n    at ~3B marks the point where confounding overtakes signal quality.'\n  analysis: '7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。\n    这不是方法论failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— \"the models most in need\n    of calibration (large, highly capable) are precisely those where calibration is\n    least feasible\"。 对reframed论文：identifiability map获得了第三个维度（signal quality × model\n    count × model scale）， 且scale维度是最novel的——prior identifiability分析未考虑\"ability confounds\n    detection\"。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Signal × regime AUC heatmap：4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam,\n    RL}。 worst档下关键假设\"cliff-like degradation under RL\"不成立—— degradation是gradual且benchmark-dependent的，无清晰regime\n    boundary。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auc_heatmap:\n      base_embedding: 0.76\n      base_minkpp: 0.72\n      base_constat: 0.69\n      base_selfcritique: 0.58\n      sft_clean_embedding: 0.7\n      sft_clean_minkpp: 0.64\n      sft_clean_constat: 0.61\n      sft_clean_selfcritique: 0.56\n      sft_contam_embedding: 0.71\n      sft_contam_minkpp: 0.66\n      sft_contam_constat: 0.63\n      sft_contam_selfcritique: 0.6\n      rl_embedding: 0.58\n      rl_minkpp: 0.52\n      rl_constat: 0.5\n      rl_selfcritique: 0.54\n    signal_survival_rate_sft_avg: 0.9\n    signal_survival_rate_rl_avg: 0.74\n    rl_best_signal: selfcritique\n    rl_best_signal_auc: 0.54\n    rl_all_signals_below_060: true\n    sft_clean_vs_contam_auc_diff_avg: 0.02\n    regime_effect_anova_pvalue: 0.008\n    cliff_test_sft_to_rl_is_cliff: false\n    cliff_test_gradual_slope: -0.035\n    benchmark_specific_signal_ordering_changes: true\n    mmlu_best_rl_signal: embedding\n    mmlu_rl_embedding_auc: 0.6\n    gsm8k_best_rl_signal: selfcritique\n    gsm8k_rl_selfcritique_auc: 0.56\n    humaneval_best_rl_signal: constat\n    humaneval_rl_constat_auc: 0.53\n  result_rationale: 'signal survival分析在worst档下揭示了detection信号的systematic fragility，\n    但关键的\"cliff-like degradation\"假设未得到支持： (1) Base→SFT→RL确实存在degradation trend（ANOVA\n    p=0.008），但是gradual而非cliff-like—— 每个regime transition（Base→SFT, SFT→RL）的AUC drop\n    ~0.035/step， 没有在任何specific boundary出现sharp discontinuity。这refutes了\"clean regime\n    boundaries\"的假设； (2) SFT clean vs contaminated差异仅0.02 AUC——信号主要检测\"training change\"而非\n    \"contamination change\"，SFT本身（无论内容）就改变了model representations enough to affect detection\n    signals。这是一个methodological concern：信号的SFT-regime AUC 可能partly由SFT procedure本身驱动而非contamination；\n    (3) Self-Critique在RL下\"最佳\"（0.54）但是pyrrhic victory——0.54的AUC 仅比random（0.50）好4pp，sensitivity+specificity之和≈1.08，几乎无practical\n    value。 且这个\"最佳\"因benchmark而异：MMLU上embedding更好（0.60），GSM8K上Self-Critique更好（0.56），\n    HumanEval上ConStat更好（0.53）——没有universal winner意味着无法有principled的 \"RL regime下用什么信号\"的recommendation；\n    (4) All signals在RL下<0.60，confirm了exp-004的identifiability threshold prediction——\n    RL regime系统性落在identifiability boundary以下，任何calibration method都无法工作； (5) Benchmark-specific\n    ordering changes（不同benchmark上不同信号\"最佳\"） 说明信号quality与benchmark type交互，不是universal\n    property—— 这对practical deployment是一个complication（需要per-benchmark signal selection）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - Base\n    - SFT-Clean\n    - SFT-Contam\n    - RL\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.58\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.52\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.5\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.54\n  - name: 'Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - SFT-Clean\n    - SFT-Contam\n    - RL\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding Retrieval\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.76\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.72\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.72\n    - - Self-Critique\n      - 0.97\n      - 1.03\n      - 0.93\n  - name: 'Table: Best Signal by Regime × Benchmark (AUC)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - SFT-best\n    - SFT-AUC\n    - RL-best\n    - RL-AUC\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - Embedding\n      - 0.74\n      - Embedding\n      - 0.6\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Min-K++\n      - 0.65\n      - Self-Critique\n      - 0.56\n    - - ARC-C\n      - Embedding\n      - 0.7\n      - Self-Critique\n      - 0.55\n    - - HumanEval\n      - Embedding\n      - 0.72\n      - ConStat\n      - 0.53\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4×4 heatmap. Left-to-right degradation gradient visible但不是cliff—— color\n    change是gradual。RL column almost uniformly orange/red但不是sudden drop。 Self-Critique\n    row最stable（最少color change）但absolute level最低。'\n  - 'Fig: AUC degradation trajectories (4 lines for 4 signals across 4 regimes). 所有线呈gradual\n    downward slope而非step function。 Annotated: ''No cliff detected — slope test p=0.35\n    for piecewise vs linear''.'\n  analysis: 'signal survival在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution，但finding从 \"cliff-like\n    degradation\"改为\"gradual, benchmark-dependent degradation refuting clean regime\n    boundaries\"。这个reframe实际上更novel： (1) 它challenge了detection community中隐含的\"signals\n    work until they don''t\"的binary thinking； (2) 它建立了\"signal quality is a continuous,\n    context-dependent quantity\"的empirical evidence； (3) Benchmark-specific signal\n    ordering在RL regime下的变化是一个practical finding—— 不存在universal \"best signal for RL\"，需要adaptive\n    signal selection。 关键叙事转变：从\"Self-Critique compensates where others fail\"到 \"no signal\n    compensates adequately in any regime beyond SFT\"。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'RL-trained models（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）的观察性案例。 worst档下calibration在RL\n    regime完全失效，expected regret reduction为零或负。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    models_evaluated: 8\n    selfcritique_auc_avg_rl: 0.54\n    rrf_auc_avg_rl: 0.53\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 11.2\n    calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp: 9.5\n    calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp: 8.8\n    calibration_mae_linear_pp: 10.2\n    calibration_mae_dcr_pp: 9.0\n    ci_width_95_avg_pp: 24.0\n    ci_coverage_95: 0.8\n    ci_coverage_80: 0.62\n    expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: -0.05\n    expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: -0.1\n    top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true: 0.6\n    gamma_estimates_mean: 0.06\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct: 0.88\n    nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_value: 0.02\n    nearzero_gamma_clean_check_pass: true\n    deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    deepseek_r1_7b_gamma: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'RL observational是worst档中最dramatic的negative result——calibration\n    actively hurts： (1) Signal AUC 0.53-0.54在RL regime下（exp-008已预测），exposure scores本质上是random\n    noise， 输入到IRT的是garbage——garbage-in-garbage-out； (2) 4PL+γ MAE 11.2pp比uncalibrated\n    9.5pp还差1.7pp——模型在noisy exposure上\"hallucinate\"了 不存在的contamination effect，做出了比不校正更差的adjustment：\n    false positives被overcorrect（本来对的答案被down-adjust）， true positives被undercorrect（真正contaminated的items信号太弱未被识别）；\n    (3) Expected regret为-0.05（vs uncalibrated）和-0.10（vs remove-rescore）， calibration使model\n    selection决策literally变差——宽CI（24pp）使rankings变得更noisy 而uncalibrated scores虽biased但至少preserves\n    relative ordering better； (4) 88%的conditions下γ CI包含零——模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination，\n    不是\"检测到但校正不够\"而是\"γ与zero不可区分\"。 Mean γ=0.06接近clean benchmark的specificity check（γ=0.02），\n    说明RL模型和clean data上的γ estimates没有meaningful difference； (5) DCR和remove-rescore在RL下也不好（9.0pp/8.8pp\n    vs naive 9.5pp）， 但至少没有actively hurt——simpler methods的conservatism在low-signal regime下是一个virtue。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Case Study — Method Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - MAE_pp\n    - CI Width 95%\n    - Coverage 95%\n    - Regret Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Uncalibrated (naive)\n      - 9.5\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 4PL+γ\n      - 11.2\n      - 24.0\n      - 0.8\n      - -0.05\n    - - Remove-rescore\n      - 8.8\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Linear regression+CI\n      - 10.2\n      - 20.5\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.01\n    - - DCR\n      - 9.0\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - gamma_mean\n    - gamma_95ci_lower\n    - gamma_95ci_upper\n    - ci_excludes_zero\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.1\n      - -0.18\n      - 0.38\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.07\n      - -0.2\n      - 0.34\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      - 0.05\n      - -0.22\n      - 0.32\n      - false\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 0.02\n      - -0.28\n      - 0.32\n      - false\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n      - 0.08\n      - -0.16\n      - 0.32\n      - false\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n      - 0.04\n      - -0.22\n      - 0.3\n      - false\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Expected regret curves. Uncalibrated line sits below 4PL+γ across all selection\n    sizes. 4PL+γ is literally the worst choice——high variance bootstrap replicates\n    show no scenario where it consistently wins.'\n  - 'Fig: γ forest plot for RL models. All CIs cross zero. CI spans (~0.5) dwarf point\n    estimates (~0.02-0.10). Visual impression: ''nothing was detected.'''\n  analysis: 'RL case study提供了worst档最compelling的negative result：calibration not merely\n    fails to help but actively harms decision quality in the RL regime。 (1) 这是因为signal\n    AUC<0.55时IRT的额外parameters成为pure noise amplifiers； (2) Practical recommendation：\"do\n    not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\"—— 这是一个clear, actionable, negative\n    finding with theoretical backing from exp-004； (3) Specificity check通过（γ=0.02\n    on clean benchmark）是唯一positive—— 模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real\n    contamination。 DCR/remove-rescore在RL下也mediocre，supporting \"the problem is intractable,\n    not the method\"。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_family_validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '非Qwen模型家族（Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B）的controlled SFT注入验证，3 dosage levels。\n    worst档下第二模型家族结果与Qwen方向不一致或因GPU预算耗尽无法完成。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model_family: Llama-3.2-1B\n    dosages_completed:\n    - 0%\n    - 25%\n    - 100%\n    seeds_completed: 1\n    gpu_budget_exhausted_partial: true\n    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 5.8\n    mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 1.5\n    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 2.2\n    signal_auc_embedding_100pct: 0.62\n    signal_auc_rrf_100pct: 0.6\n    calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp: 9.5\n    calibration_mae_qwen_1_5b_matched_pp: 6.2\n    multi_family_mae_gap_pp: 6.5\n    gamma_estimate_100pct: 0.2\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct: true\n    gamma_direction_consistent_with_qwen: false\n    inflation_pattern_consistent_with_qwen: false\n    inflation_pattern_difference: Llama inflation更集中在MMLU（5.8pp vs GSM8K 2.2pp）， 与Qwen的更均匀分布不同。γ\n      estimate方向一致（positive）但magnitude不同（0.20 vs 0.40）， 且CI包含零而Qwen在100%dosage下不包含。\n  result_rationale: 'multi-family validation在worst档下暴露了generalizability的fundamental\n    challenge： (1) GPU预算紧张——Llama-3.2-1B的SFT需要重新适配tokenizer和training config， 调试时间消耗了buffer\n    hours，最终只完成3个dosage level×1 seed（计划是3 dosages×3 seeds）； (2) Llama-3.2-1B的inflation\n    pattern与Qwen2.5-1.5B系统性不同—— Llama在MMLU上inflation 5.8pp vs GSM8K仅2.2pp（ratio 2.6:1），\n    而Qwen在matched scale(1.5B)上是7.4pp vs 4.8pp（ratio 1.5:1）。 这说明contamination effect是architecture-dependent的，挑战了γ的universal\n    interpretation； (3) Signal AUC在Llama上更低（embedding 0.62 vs Qwen 0.72）—— 可能因为Llama的tokenization和embedding\n    space与signal tools（基于sentence-transformers） 的compatibility不同，或Llama的SFT dynamics导致不同的memorization\n    pattern； (4) γ CI在Llama 100%dosage下包含零（而Qwen不包含）——即使在最极端的contamination下 Llama模型的contamination\n    effect也不可被reliable地检测，进一步收窄了identifiability map； (5) Calibration MAE gap 6.5pp（Llama\n    9.5pp vs Qwen 6.2pp at matched scale）—— 3.3pp的差距远超跨seed variance（<1.5pp），说明method\n    performance是family-specific的， 不能从一个model family泛化到另一个。 仅1 seed使所有comparisons都是underpowered的——这一限制需要在paper中explicitly\n    disclosed。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-Family Comparison (Llama-3.2-1B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B, 100% dosage)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen2.5-1.5B\n    - Llama-3.2-1B\n    - gap\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU inflation (pp)\n      - 7.4\n      - 5.8\n      - -1.6\n    - - GSM8K inflation (pp)\n      - 4.8\n      - 2.2\n      - -2.6\n    - - Embedding AUC\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.62\n      - -0.1\n    - - RRF AUC\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.6\n      - -0.08\n    - - γ estimate\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.2\n      - -0.2\n    - - γ CI excludes zero\n      - true\n      - false\n      - —\n    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n      - 6.2\n      - 9.5\n      - 3.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Side-by-side inflation curves (Qwen vs Llama) across dosages. Qwen curve\n    steeper and more linear; Llama curve flatter with larger error bars (1 seed).\n    Different shapes suggest different contamination dynamics.'\n  analysis: 'multi-family结果是worst档generalizability concern的direct confirmation。 6.5pp\n    MAE gap（在[4.0, 10.0]范围内）说明ContamCal的calibration accuracy 是model-family-dependent的——这是一个significant\n    limitation因为paper claims need to generalize。 reframed论文策略：(1) Acknowledge limitation\n    explicitly with quantified gap； (2) Argue this supports the \"possibility frontier\"\n    framing——identifiability map is family-specific, further narrowing the conditions\n    under which calibration works； (3) Single-seed caveat needs prominent placement\n    in limitations section。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析（仅推理，无SFT）。worst档下frontier scale 使所有信号接近random，γ不可与zero区分。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    signal_auc_embedding: 0.58\n    signal_auc_minkpp: 0.54\n    signal_auc_constat: 0.52\n    signal_auc_selfcritique: 0.56\n    rrf_auc: 0.56\n    gamma_estimate: 0.03\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero: true\n    gamma_ci_width: 0.6\n    calibration_mae_pp: 11.8\n    ci_width_95_pp: 27.0\n    ci_coverage_95: 0.78\n  result_rationale: '72B将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎确定包含benchmark items的某种形式——\n    这不是\"contamination\"而是\"knowledge acquisition\"，使得\"contaminated vs clean\"的 binary\n    distinction在概念层面就不再清晰。所有detection signals的false positive rate极高， embedding retrieval\n    AUC降至0.58因为72B legitimately \"knows\" nearly everything in benchmarks； (2) γ=0.03几乎为零，不是因为无contamination而是因为unable\n    to detect—— 信号noise完全淹没了any real signal，CI width 0.60意味着γ的95%CI覆盖[-0.27, 0.33]，\n    这个range trivially包含了从\"no contamination\"到\"moderate contamination\"的所有可能； (3) 11.8pp\n    MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error——72B的item response patterns 系统性不同于smaller models（difficulty\n    ordering不同、ceiling effects更多）， IRT parameters的transferability across scales受到根本挑战；\n    (4) 27pp CI width使calibration statement完全vacuous——\"score在±13.5pp范围内\" 对于一个82%准确率的72B模型意味着\"真实score在68.5%-95.5%之间\"，无actionable\n    value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Results vs Controlled Models'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen-3B (ctrl)\n    - Qwen-7B (ctrl)\n    - Qwen-72B (obs)\n    rows:\n    - - Best signal AUC\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.58\n    - - RRF AUC\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.56\n    - - γ estimate\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.03\n    - - γ CI excludes zero\n      - true\n      - marginal\n      - false\n    - - Calibration MAE (pp)\n      - 6.8\n      - 8.2\n      - 11.8\n    - - CI width 95% (pp)\n      - 9.5\n      - 11.5\n      - 27.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scale vs signal AUC from 0.5B→72B (log scale X). Monotonic decrease. Horizontal\n    line at AUC=0.72（Fisher threshold）crossed between 1.5B and 3B。 72B深入''unidentifiable\n    zone''。Extrapolation line suggests >100B models would be at chance.'\n  analysis: '72B是identifiability story的natural endpoint和strongest rhetoric： \"The very\n    models most scrutinized for contamination (large, frontier) are precisely those\n    where our theoretical analysis proves calibration is infeasible. This is not a\n    limitation of ContamCal but a fundamental property of the problem: as models grow\n    larger, the boundary between ''knowledge'' and ''contamination'' blurs, and detection\n    signals lose their discriminative power.\" 这个framing将worst-tier result转化为paper的powerful\n    closing argument。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: '2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight\n    models。 worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行，Kendall τ低于0.5。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct: 0.62\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct: 0.56\n    two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct: 0.53\n    calibration_mae_2signal_pp: 9.8\n    calibration_mae_4signal_pp: 6.8\n    mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4: 0.44\n    ci_width_95_2signal_pp: 22.0\n    ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.74\n    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.52\n    gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct: 0.75\n    dcr_mae_on_same_conditions_pp: 8.5\n    two_signal_worse_than_dcr: true\n  result_rationale: '2-signal mode在worst档下是最不viable的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002），\n    fusion AUC 0.62远低于identifiability threshold 0.72—— closed-weight场景下可用的信号恰好是最差的，因为最好的信号（Embedding,\n    Min-K++） 需要model internals access（embeddings, logits）； (2) MAE增加44%（6.8→9.8pp）——接近uncalibrated\n    raw score的MAE（8.5pp）， 说明calibration几乎没有净价值； (3) Kendall τ降至0.52——刚刚高于random（0.50），calibrated\n    rankings 与true rankings的agreement barely better than coin flip； (4) 75%的conditions下γ\n    CI包含零——在closed-weight scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行； (5) DCR在same conditions下MAE\n    8.5pp，优于2-signal ContamCal的9.8pp—— simpler method再次胜出，因为DCR不依赖信号aggregation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal vs DCR'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - 4-signal\n    - 2-signal\n    - DCR\n    - degradation\n    rows:\n    - - RRF AUC (100%)\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.62\n      - —\n      - -8.8%\n    - - MAE (pp)\n      - 6.8\n      - 9.8\n      - 8.5\n      - +44%\n    - - CI Width 95% (pp)\n      - 9.5\n      - 22.0\n      - —\n      - +132%\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.68\n      - -28%\n    - - Coverage 95%\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.74\n      - —\n      - -2.6%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE distributions. 2-signal distribution shifted far\n    right with heavy tail. Minimal overlap — degradation is systematic, not occasional.'\n  analysis: 2-signal failure confirms critical practical constraint：closed-weight\n    models (GPT-4, Claude等)——恰好是contamination scrutiny最高的——是calibration最不可行的targets。\n    identifiability map需要\"signal access level\"维度：full-access(4-signal)的viable region\n    已经很小（AUC>0.72, N>80），closed-weight(2-signal)的viable region几乎不存在 （需要AUC>0.85 AND\n    N>150，现实中不可能达到）。 这是reframed论文的一个strong practical insight： \"The models with the\n    least transparency are also the most opaque to calibration.\"\n","numLines":1547,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1547}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TbTDbwR9T5yJ2tTtvvSzHV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2027 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Submission Instructions - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/submission-instructions/\"},{\"title\":\"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"Overview of the AI Review System\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/\"},{\"title\":\"ICWSM 2026: Submit\",\"url\":\"https://www.icwsm.org/2026/submit.html\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026%2FConference\"}]\n\nI found relevant results related to AAAI reviewer guidelines. Here are the key resources:\n\n## AAAI-26 Reviewer Resources\n\nThe search results point to several official AAAI-26 reviewer resources:\n\n1. **Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\n\n2. **Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/, which requires all persons involved in the evaluation of submissions to adhere to AAAI ethical review guidelines\n\n3. **AAAI-26 Review Process** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\n\n## AI-Assisted Review System\n\nAAAI-26 implements a pilot program for an AI-Assisted Peer Review System to better understand whether and how AI can be effectively used in the AAAI review process. The pilot program provides supplementary information in the form of AI-generated reviews and summaries that do not contain ratings or recommendations, and these will not play any formal role in the review process except being visible to assigned reviewers, area chairs, and appropriate Program Committee members.\n\nIf you need more detailed information about the specific review form or guidelines, I recommend visiting the official AAAI-26 website links above, as they contain the complete documentation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96df0b3b-89a3-4c1d-a37a-4bedcebb08c8","uuid":"33baaf90-f2c3-49d6-85e9-fd40fe6b6c75","timestamp":"2026-05-13T18:09:49.275Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2027 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01QR9NrPs3rLKGLXFaq1caCk","content":[{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Submission Instructions - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/submission-instructions/"},{"title":"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"Overview of the AI Review System","url":"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf"},{"title":"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/"},{"title":"ICWSM 2026: Submit","url":"https://www.icwsm.org/2026/submit.html"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026%2FConference"}]},"I found relevant results related to AAAI reviewer guidelines. Here are the key resources:\n\n## AAAI-26 Reviewer Resources\n\nThe search results point to several official AAAI-26 reviewer resources:\n\n1. **Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\n\n2. **Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/, which requires all persons involved in the evaluation of submissions to adhere to AAAI ethical review guidelines\n\n3. **AAAI-26 Review Process** - Available at https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\n\n## AI-Assisted Review System\n\nAAAI-26 implements a pilot program for an AI-Assisted Peer Review System to better understand whether and how AI can be effectively used in the AAAI review process. The pilot program provides supplementary information in the form of AI-generated reviews and summaries that do not contain ratings or recommendations, and these will not play any formal role in the review process except being visible to assigned reviewers, area chairs, and appropriate Program Committee members.\n\nIf you need more detailed information about the specific review form or guideline