{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RNjPC2FzvXsDbaNogaVnUi","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 contamcal-irt-calibration 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (4 个)\\n\\n- **exp_001_sft_injection**: PREPARING — \\n- **exp_004_sim_sweep**: RUNNING — \\n- **mvp_sim_confounding**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-13\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_004_sim_sweep | 4PL+γ IRT parameter recovery degrades gracefully with exposure signal quality (AUC); there exists a minimum AUC threshold below which γ 95% CI width exceeds 15pp; recovery improves with N_models; prior sensitivity is bounded | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_001_sft_injection（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp_sim_confounding** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can still separate γ from θ when exposure is confounded with ability (corr≈0.4); if not, need model-level random effect for exposure\\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can separate contamination effect (γ) from true ability (θ) on synthetic data; γ posterior recovers true value within ±0.15, θ correlation >0.9\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01StMkgFznUJ2jWkHjGWh7eb","session_id":"96df0b3b-89a3-4c1d-a37a-4bedcebb08c8","uuid":"f7cc6e01-b051-4597-9e33-9c868f542aa4","timestamp":"2026-05-13T18:11:39.629Z"}
