{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XHZem3dGTgQf7jUr1kaa7K","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contamcal-irt-calibration — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 17:14 UTC | 更新原因: D006: 投稿目标改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25，12 天冲刺计划\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nContamCal：post-hoc statistical calibration via contamination-augmented 4PL IRT。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25**（D006, 距今 12 天）\\\\n- Track: ML for NLP / Resources and Evaluation\\\\n- Special theme: \\\\\\\"New Missions for NLP Research\\\\\\\" — contamination/data governance\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）\\\\n- **exp-004**: subset sweep 运行中（12 conditions × 10 seeds，~8-12h CPU）\\\\n- **论文**: Agent 正在写 Introduction + Method LaTeX 初稿\\\\n- **Dream D2**: re-dream 运行中（dream_20260513T171200），验证 framing/plan 修改\\\\n- **GPU**: 等待用户开服务器（用户承诺充足资源）\\\\n\\\\n## 12 天冲刺计划\\\\n\\\\n### Day 1-2 (May 13-14): 基础设施 + 并行启动\\\\n- [ ] 用户开 GPU 服务器（4+ H100/A100-80G）\\\\n- [x] exp-004 subset sweep 运行中\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 SFT injection 启动（15 runs 并行化到 4 GPU，wall-clock ~13h）\\\\n- [ ] 论文 Introduction + Method 初稿完成\\\\n\\\\n### Day 3-4 (May 15-16): 信号计算\\\\n- [ ] exp-002 信号 pipeline（4 signals on all models）\\\\n- [ ] exp-003 RRF ablation\\\\n- [ ] exp-004 全量 sweep（如 subset 结果 OK）\\\\n- [ ] exp-005 noise propagation\\\\n\\\\n### Day 5-6 (May 17-18): IRT 校准 + 分析\\\\n- [ ] exp-006 IRT calibration + 7 baselines\\\\n- [ ] exp-008 signal survival analysis（P0）\\\\n- [ ] 分析 + 图表生成\\\\n\\\\n### Day 7-8 (May 19-20): 论文 + P1 实验\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent full draft\\\\n- [ ] exp-007 7B scale-bridging（如 GPU 允许）\\\\n- [ ] exp-009 RL case study（如时间允许）\\\\n- [ ] **Day-8 checkpoint**: behind schedule → cut to MMLU+GSM8K，drop P1\\\\n\\\\n### Day 9-10 (May 21-22): 迭代\\\\n- [ ] Revi